  ('EOW', 241388, 'tv', 'Every mission shapes a legacy.', 'Follow the adventures of brave Wakandan warriors throughout history in this globe-trotting adventure, where they must carry out dangerous missions to retrieve Vibranium artifacts from the enemies of Wakanda. They are the Hatut Zaraze and this is their story.', '/yuOfb1MgnaGPa4guzV0n1IFYVGN.jpg', '/cWO5NDkKqpOuwxu4vFc4PtL8aNF.jpg', '2025-08-01', 6.2, '[]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/241388-eyes-of-wakanda/watch?locale=IN'),
  ('CA1', 1771, 'movie', 'The one who never gives up awakens.', 'During World War II, Steve Rogers is a sickly man from Brooklyn who''s transformed into super-soldier Captain America to aid in the war effort. Rogers must stop the Red Skull – Adolf Hitler''s ruthless head of weaponry, and the leader of an organization that intends to use a mysterious device of untold powers for world domination.', '/vSNxAJTlD0r02V9sPYpOjqDZXUK.jpg', '/yFuKvT4Vm3sKHdFY4eG6I4ldAnn.jpg', '2011-07-22', 7, '[{"name":"Chris Evans","character":"Captain America / Steve Rogers","profilePath":"/3bOGNsHlrswhyW79uvIHH1V43JI.jpg"},{"name":"Hayley Atwell","character":"Peggy Carter","profilePath":"/x57wXHexIjD2ywly9cRA4rov7cu.jpg"},{"name":"Sebastian Stan","character":"James Buchanan ''Bucky'' Barnes","profilePath":"/v20RLWst39klatsqUgSrwHxhwee.jpg"},{"name":"Tommy Lee Jones","character":"Colonel Chester Phillips","profilePath":"/mCiZNRAzbnPojJEZwVZWLw9kzxR.jpg"},{"name":"Hugo Weaving","character":"Johann Schmidt / Red Skull","profilePath":"/lSC8Et0PYi5zeQb3IpPkFje7hgR.jpg"},{"name":"Dominic Cooper","character":"Howard Stark","profilePath":"/wFPdARerxpaAaHucYGTSNqViWpn.jpg"},{"name":"Richard Armitage","character":"Heinz Kruger","profilePath":"/oNoKjTOUNUiJ01UNQSCQDkt5EHi.jpg"},{"name":"Stanley Tucci","character":"Dr. Abraham Erskine","profilePath":"/q4TanMDI5Rgsvw4SfyNbPBh4URr.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1771-captain-america-the-first-avenger/watch?locale=IN'),
  ('CM', 299537, 'movie', 'Higher. Further. Faster.', 'The story follows Carol Danvers as she becomes one of the universe’s most powerful heroes when Earth is caught in the middle of a galactic war between two alien races. Set in the 1990s, Captain Marvel is an all-new adventure from a previously unseen period in the history of the Marvel Cinematic Universe.', '/AtsgWhDnHTq68L0lLsUrCnM7TjG.jpg', '/qAzYK4YPSWDc7aa4R43LcwRIAyb.jpg', '2019-03-06', 6.8, '[{"name":"Brie Larson","character":"Carol Danvers / Vers / Captain Marvel","profilePath":"/iqZ5uKJWbwSITCK4CqdlUHZTnXD.jpg"},{"name":"Samuel L. Jackson","character":"Nick Fury","profilePath":"/qdfRtvPCj51C9Uy5VEgjgj69JyV.jpg"},{"name":"Ben Mendelsohn","character":"Talos / Keller","profilePath":"/pA9mu9D2IolVA0v2Yo0tJm6uUyI.jpg"},{"name":"Jude Law","character":"Yon-Rogg","profilePath":"/6UadpSbfC39WMChAcdnNunzwDxv.jpg"},{"name":"Annette Bening","character":"Supreme Intelligence / Dr. Wendy Lawson","profilePath":"/kGslMAWcpv8MKzODhDRDkFE0uX7.jpg"},{"name":"Djimon Hounsou","character":"Korath","profilePath":"/tpvtxxvCx2Mb5DV632hmuYlHoiY.jpg"},{"name":"Lee Pace","character":"Ronan","profilePath":"/eeTc0d2AX1vFYVxZ6Qw7qZpg4Tz.jpg"},{"name":"Lashana Lynch","character":"Maria Rambeau","profilePath":"/ypNxRag9uJ5nzPAN2um3amQK340.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/299537-captain-marvel/watch?locale=IN'),
  ('IM1', 1726, 'movie', 'Heroes aren''t born. They''re built.', 'After being held captive in an Afghan cave, billionaire engineer Tony Stark creates a unique weaponized suit of armor to fight evil.', '/78lPtwv72eTNqFW9COBYI0dWDJa.jpg', '/cyecB7godJ6kNHGONFjUyVN9OX5.jpg', '2008-04-30', 7.7, '[{"name":"Robert Downey Jr.","character":"Tony Stark","profilePath":"/5qHNjhtjMD4YWH3UP0rm4tKwxCL.jpg"},{"name":"Terrence Howard","character":"Rhodey","profilePath":"/wXWt2NSY23v7DHe2yZQ1C8TikBp.jpg"},{"name":"Jeff Bridges","character":"Obadiah Stane","profilePath":"/xms1RAY6q7Lzp7wNeRCB0kzhucn.jpg"},{"name":"Gwyneth Paltrow","character":"Pepper Potts","profilePath":"/x040uB0CDrHjVAUSONw8bbWMvDC.jpg"},{"name":"Leslie Bibb","character":"Christine Everhart","profilePath":"/g3a1O9lOTZvrwQupUtg4Fc3CdTd.jpg"},{"name":"Shaun Toub","character":"Yinsen","profilePath":"/6fuJ9D50bYuMAhrlEgVqzgqF0LU.jpg"},{"name":"Faran Tahir","character":"Raza","profilePath":"/dMsD7h6KiZ5dM0f9MegXUOKnqb0.jpg"},{"name":"Clark Gregg","character":"Agent Coulson","profilePath":"/mq686D91XoZpqkzELn0888NOiZW.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1726-iron-man/watch?locale=IN'),
  ('IH', 1724, 'movie', 'You''ll like him when he''s angry.', 'Scientist Bruce Banner scours the planet for an antidote to the unbridled force of rage within him: the Hulk. But when the military masterminds who dream of exploiting his powers force him back to civilization, he finds himself coming face to face with a new, deadly foe.', '/gKzYx79y0AQTL4UAk1cBQJ3nvrm.jpg', '/jPu8yiadqgzwFPGKJmGo637ASVP.jpg', '2008-06-12', 6.3, '[{"name":"Edward Norton","character":"Bruce Banner","profilePath":"/8nytsqL59SFJTVYVrN72k6qkGgJ.jpg"},{"name":"Liv Tyler","character":"Betty Ross","profilePath":"/aYlqS4wYuNCiN9wmvDwKRAE9BQ9.jpg"},{"name":"Tim Roth","character":"Emil Blonsky","profilePath":"/qSizF2i9gz6c6DbAC5RoIq8sVqX.jpg"},{"name":"William Hurt","character":"General ''Thunderbolt'' Ross","profilePath":"/j3mjmuHLBW4XQSw53C8Sh0Lh3ZQ.jpg"},{"name":"Tim Blake Nelson","character":"Samuel Sterns","profilePath":"/rWuTGiAMaaHIJ30eRkQS23LbRSW.jpg"},{"name":"Ty Burrell","character":"Leonard","profilePath":"/4dwlnG1dcEPAf2cjNsYbYJn5E8Y.jpg"},{"name":"Christina Cabot","character":"Major Kathleen Sparr","profilePath":"/h1vwbOfITSvDvDq8E9MVvWqMYSr.jpg"},{"name":"Peter Mensah","character":"General Joe Greller","profilePath":"/72L6LbeF5ZqRdLmhibNqysQNQRg.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/1724-the-incredible-hulk/watch?locale=IN'),
  ('IM2', 10138, 'movie', 'It''s not the armor that makes the hero, but the man inside.', 'With the world now aware of his dual life as the armored superhero Iron Man, billionaire inventor Tony Stark faces pressure from the government, the press and the public to share his technology with the military. Unwilling to let go of his invention, Stark, with Pepper Potts and James ''Rhodey'' Rhodes at his side, must forge new alliances – and confront powerful enemies.', '/6WBeq4fCfn7AN0o21W9qNcRF2l9.jpg', '/7lmBufEG7P7Y1HClYK3gCxYrkgS.jpg', '2010-04-28', 6.9, '[{"name":"Robert Downey Jr.","character":"Tony Stark","profilePath":"/5qHNjhtjMD4YWH3UP0rm4tKwxCL.jpg"},{"name":"Gwyneth Paltrow","character":"Pepper Potts","profilePath":"/x040uB0CDrHjVAUSONw8bbWMvDC.jpg"},{"name":"Don Cheadle","character":"Lt. Col. James ''Rhodey'' Rhodes","profilePath":"/umhTmcVF26qZKEpSfG1ZNpcbs9D.jpg"},{"name":"Scarlett Johansson","character":"Natalie Rushman / Natasha Romanoff","profilePath":"/druW5adKddizHNSoPbI0q7Mvn0K.jpg"},{"name":"Sam Rockwell","character":"Justin Hammer","profilePath":"/afYhNpLwpa65Yy0Q0g00FNFhzx5.jpg"},{"name":"Mickey Rourke","character":"Ivan Vanko","profilePath":"/i6vXukUwRsJa7S9yhZgoKt9xLDv.jpg"},{"name":"Samuel L. Jackson","character":"Nick Fury","profilePath":"/qdfRtvPCj51C9Uy5VEgjgj69JyV.jpg"},{"name":"Clark Gregg","character":"Agent Coulson","profilePath":"/mq686D91XoZpqkzELn0888NOiZW.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/10138-iron-man-2/watch?locale=IN'),
  ('TH1', 10195, 'movie', 'Courage is immortal.', 'Against his father Odin''s will, The Mighty Thor - a powerful but arrogant warrior god - recklessly reignites an ancient war. Thor is cast down to Earth and forced to live among humans as punishment. Once here, Thor learns what it takes to be a true hero when the most dangerous villain of his world sends the darkest forces of Asgard to invade Earth.', '/prSfAi1xGrhLQNxVSUFh61xQ4Qy.jpg', '/cDJ61O1STtbWNBwefuqVrRe3d7l.jpg', '2011-04-21', 6.8, '[{"name":"Chris Hemsworth","character":"Thor","profilePath":"/piQGdoIQOF3C1EI5cbYZLAW1gfj.jpg"},{"name":"Natalie Portman","character":"Jane Foster","profilePath":"/edPU5HxncLWa1YkgRPNkSd68ONG.jpg"},{"name":"Tom Hiddleston","character":"Loki","profilePath":"/mclHxMm8aPlCPKptP67257F5GPo.jpg"},{"name":"Anthony Hopkins","character":"Odin","profilePath":"/iaf7SHSkGDpnyrDh1Jolilwk2TD.jpg"},{"name":"Stellan Skarsgård","character":"Erik Selvig","profilePath":"/mW7xmtGV4y79kQGn0zkKVGDMAmw.jpg"},{"name":"Kat Dennings","character":"Darcy Lewis","profilePath":"/nJHGtedRCIeAdysg18oJngUZmL3.jpg"},{"name":"Clark Gregg","character":"Agent Coulson","profilePath":"/mq686D91XoZpqkzELn0888NOiZW.jpg"},{"name":"Colm Feore","character":"King Laufey","profilePath":"/oOxcf1qB1IvVZrBEE1PdrfMiyBK.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/10195-thor/watch?locale=IN'),
  ('AV1', 24428, 'movie', 'Some assembly required.', 'When an unexpected enemy emerges and threatens global safety and security, Nick Fury, director of the international peacekeeping agency known as S.H.I.E.L.D., finds himself in need of a team to pull the world back from the brink of disaster. Spanning the globe, a daring recruitment effort begins!', '/RYMX2wcKCBAr24UyPD7xwmjaTn.jpg', '/9BBTo63ANSmhC4e6r62OJFuK2GL.jpg', '2012-04-25', 8.1, '[{"name":"Robert Downey Jr.","character":"Tony Stark / Iron Man","profilePath":"/5qHNjhtjMD4YWH3UP0rm4tKwxCL.jpg"},{"name":"Chris Evans","character":"Steve Rogers / Captain America","profilePath":"/3bOGNsHlrswhyW79uvIHH1V43JI.jpg"},{"name":"Mark Ruffalo","character":"Bruce Banner / The Hulk","profilePath":"/5GilHMOt5PAQh6rlUKZzGmaKEI7.jpg"},{"name":"Chris Hemsworth","character":"Thor","profilePath":"/piQGdoIQOF3C1EI5cbYZLAW1gfj.jpg"},{"name":"Scarlett Johansson","character":"Natasha Romanoff / Black Widow","profilePath":"/druW5adKddizHNSoPbI0q7Mvn0K.jpg"},{"name":"Jeremy Renner","character":"Clint Barton / Hawkeye","profilePath":"/yB84D1neTYXfWBaV0QOE9RF2VCu.jpg"},{"name":"Tom Hiddleston","character":"Loki","profilePath":"/mclHxMm8aPlCPKptP67257F5GPo.jpg"},{"name":"Clark Gregg","character":"Agent Phil Coulson","profilePath":"/mq686D91XoZpqkzELn0888NOiZW.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/24428-the-avengers/watch?locale=IN'),
  ('DD1', 61889, 'tv', 'Do not fear the dark. Become it.', 'Lawyer-by-day Matt Murdock uses his heightened senses from being blinded as a young boy to fight crime at night on the streets of Hell’s Kitchen as Daredevil.', '/QWbPaDxiB6LW2LjASknzYBvjMj.jpg', '/pPALpad1Fh14g7ejyQjqKzlhrBw.jpg', '2015-04-10', 8.2, '[{"name":"Charlie Cox","character":"Matt Murdock / Daredevil","profilePath":"/jBHDZ8MA4I7krNQx4IfqdfPfleD.jpg"},{"name":"Deborah Ann Woll","character":"Karen Page","profilePath":"/btTnyvRLXOH0pz2SLBwyKbmnFhX.jpg"},{"name":"Elden Henson","character":"Foggy Nelson","profilePath":"/8U5g30U76UJe0erbJdWjGLVz7NF.jpg"},{"name":"Vincent D''Onofrio","character":"Wilson Fisk / Kingpin","profilePath":"/qkyiLolEqYMGH25xD4sFIXAjZQB.jpg"},{"name":"Jay Ali","character":"Rahul ''Ray'' Nadeem","profilePath":"/1g4OYoBZxIsIYBvZQ1W2wn21LJJ.jpg"},{"name":"Wilson Bethel","character":"Benjamin ''Dex'' Poindexter","profilePath":"/xHLjGi9onJXwHoZALZ9pLBVnH5x.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/61889-marvel-s-daredevil/watch?locale=IN'),
  ('JJ1', 38472, 'tv', 'Your powers can''t save you.', 'After a tragic ending to her short-lived super hero stint, Jessica Jones is rebuilding her personal life and career as a detective who gets pulled into cases involving people with extraordinary abilities in New York City.', '/oxnWofiE9fHOgUfs9NJa6nG6NTR.jpg', '/fjEOQhzZk2Or7VYUBeMx5ZIwU95.jpg', '2015-11-20', 7.5, '[{"name":"Krysten Ritter","character":"Jessica Jones","profilePath":"/d39VsFGyWq7f5fkUrCI9k3XpZl2.jpg"},{"name":"Rachael Taylor","character":"Patricia ''Trish'' Walker","profilePath":"/9K3u4xM3fnyzulvqT0cVg8s2mKt.jpg"},{"name":"Eka Darville","character":"Malcolm Ducasse","profilePath":"/7tNdST92WSTGHmEJbExaRlQHWcW.jpg"},{"name":"Benjamin Walker","character":"Erik Gelden","profilePath":"/jwM8BZ1hVcbzfs9jNndVmaocULF.jpg"},{"name":"Carrie-Anne Moss","character":"Jeryn ''Jeri'' Hogarth","profilePath":"/xD4jTA3KmVp5Rq3aHcymL9DUGjD.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/38472-marvel-s-jessica-jones/watch?locale=IN'),
