  ('JJ3', 38472, 'tv', 'Your powers can''t save you.', 'After a tragic ending to her short-lived super hero stint, Jessica Jones is rebuilding her personal life and career as a detective who gets pulled into cases involving people with extraordinary abilities in New York City.', '/oxnWofiE9fHOgUfs9NJa6nG6NTR.jpg', '/fjEOQhzZk2Or7VYUBeMx5ZIwU95.jpg', '2015-11-20', 7.5, '[{"name":"Krysten Ritter","character":"Jessica Jones","profilePath":"/d39VsFGyWq7f5fkUrCI9k3XpZl2.jpg"},{"name":"Rachael Taylor","character":"Patricia ''Trish'' Walker","profilePath":"/9K3u4xM3fnyzulvqT0cVg8s2mKt.jpg"},{"name":"Eka Darville","character":"Malcolm Ducasse","profilePath":"/7tNdST92WSTGHmEJbExaRlQHWcW.jpg"},{"name":"Benjamin Walker","character":"Erik Gelden","profilePath":"/jwM8BZ1hVcbzfs9jNndVmaocULF.jpg"},{"name":"Carrie-Anne Moss","character":"Jeryn ''Jeri'' Hogarth","profilePath":"/xD4jTA3KmVp5Rq3aHcymL9DUGjD.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/38472-marvel-s-jessica-jones/watch?locale=IN'),
  ('IM3', 68721, 'movie', 'Unleash the power behind the armor.', 'When Tony Stark''s world is torn apart by a formidable terrorist called the Mandarin, he starts an odyssey of rebuilding and retribution.', '/qhPtAc1TKbMPqNvcdXSOn9Bn7hZ.jpg', '/iVped1djsF0tvGkvnHbzsE3ZPTF.jpg', '2013-04-18', 6.9, '[{"name":"Robert Downey Jr.","character":"Tony Stark","profilePath":"/5qHNjhtjMD4YWH3UP0rm4tKwxCL.jpg"},{"name":"Gwyneth Paltrow","character":"Pepper Potts","profilePath":"/x040uB0CDrHjVAUSONw8bbWMvDC.jpg"},{"name":"Don Cheadle","character":"Colonel James Rhodes","profilePath":"/umhTmcVF26qZKEpSfG1ZNpcbs9D.jpg"},{"name":"Guy Pearce","character":"Aldrich Killian","profilePath":"/vTqk6Nh3WgqPubkS23eOlMAwmwa.jpg"},{"name":"Rebecca Hall","character":"Maya Hansen","profilePath":"/coC58ANiDbqRIyle5zEl9QDektf.jpg"},{"name":"Jon Favreau","character":"Happy Hogan","profilePath":"/8MtRRnEHaBSw8Ztdl8saXiw1egP.jpg"},{"name":"Ben Kingsley","character":"Trevor Slattery","profilePath":"/k3Dmu49B2akwDvgqy52MOxznI59.jpg"},{"name":"James Badge Dale","character":"Savin","profilePath":"/lnm8Jm11btONDU7dzPk9liuMibk.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/68721-iron-man-3/watch?locale=IN'),
  ('TH2', 76338, 'movie', 'Delve into the darkness.', 'Thor fights to restore order across the cosmos… but an ancient race led by the vengeful Malekith returns to plunge the universe back into darkness. Faced with an enemy that even Odin and Asgard cannot withstand, Thor must embark on his most perilous and personal journey yet, one that will reunite him with Jane Foster and force him to sacrifice everything to save us all.', '/wp6OxE4poJ4G7c0U2ZIXasTSMR7.jpg', '/5QEOy0QEpad9QsXeMxuGHPXMale.jpg', '2013-10-30', 6.5, '[{"name":"Chris Hemsworth","character":"Thor","profilePath":"/piQGdoIQOF3C1EI5cbYZLAW1gfj.jpg"},{"name":"Natalie Portman","character":"Jane Foster","profilePath":"/edPU5HxncLWa1YkgRPNkSd68ONG.jpg"},{"name":"Tom Hiddleston","character":"Loki","profilePath":"/mclHxMm8aPlCPKptP67257F5GPo.jpg"},{"name":"Christopher Eccleston","character":"Malekith","profilePath":"/v6ezjezzDo6xP2wlONO5ZzBciwl.jpg"},{"name":"Anthony Hopkins","character":"Odin","profilePath":"/iaf7SHSkGDpnyrDh1Jolilwk2TD.jpg"},{"name":"Jaimie Alexander","character":"Sif","profilePath":"/21IQHPAXNUHiqPrpIYr4X8h2wmf.jpg"},{"name":"Zachary Levi","character":"Fandral","profilePath":"/1W8L3kEMMPF9umT3ZGaNIiCYKfZ.jpg"},{"name":"Ray Stevenson","character":"Volstagg","profilePath":"/9QCVNDgTgDEbGsa6w3JuECEPuQz.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/76338-thor-the-dark-world/watch?locale=IN'),
  ('CA2', 100402, 'movie', 'In heroes we trust.', 'After the cataclysmic events in New York with The Avengers, Steve Rogers, aka Captain America is living quietly in Washington, D.C. and trying to adjust to the modern world. But when a S.H.I.E.L.D. colleague comes under attack, Steve becomes embroiled in a web of intrigue that threatens to put the world at risk. Joining forces with the Black Widow, Captain America struggles to expose the ever-widening conspiracy while fighting off professional assassins sent to silence him at every turn. When the full scope of the villainous plot is revealed, Captain America and the Black Widow enlist the help of a new ally, the Falcon. However, they soon find themselves up against an unexpected and formidable enemy—the Winter Soldier.', '/tVFRpFw3xTedgPGqxW0AOI8Qhh0.jpg', '/1RWLMyC9KcFfcaoViMiJGSSZzzr.jpg', '2014-03-20', 7.7, '[{"name":"Chris Evans","character":"Steve Rogers / Captain America","profilePath":"/3bOGNsHlrswhyW79uvIHH1V43JI.jpg"},{"name":"Samuel L. Jackson","character":"Nick Fury","profilePath":"/qdfRtvPCj51C9Uy5VEgjgj69JyV.jpg"},{"name":"Scarlett Johansson","character":"Natasha Romanoff / Black Widow","profilePath":"/druW5adKddizHNSoPbI0q7Mvn0K.jpg"},{"name":"Robert Redford","character":"Alexander Pierce","profilePath":"/14FuWhuwRLXCplIur2v39L5NZ1W.jpg"},{"name":"Sebastian Stan","character":"Bucky Barnes / Winter Soldier","profilePath":"/v20RLWst39klatsqUgSrwHxhwee.jpg"},{"name":"Anthony Mackie","character":"Sam Wilson / Falcon","profilePath":"/eZSIDrtTzhvabyjrmIITQLsjx8h.jpg"},{"name":"Cobie Smulders","character":"Maria Hill","profilePath":"/1b0mYokcGsfFRge4bjXlS5ihtek.jpg"},{"name":"Frank Grillo","character":"Brock Rumlow","profilePath":"/kuEco4vo1xrsM8DyrNSZUEi593P.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/100402-captain-america-the-winter-soldier/watch?locale=IN'),
  ('GG1', 118340, 'movie', 'When things get bad, they''ll do their worst.', 'Light years from Earth, 26 years after being abducted, Peter Quill finds himself the prime target of a manhunt after discovering an orb wanted by Ronan the Accuser.', '/r7vmZjiyZw9rpJMQJdXpjgiCOk9.jpg', '/uLtVbjvS1O7gXL8lUOwsFOH4man.jpg', '2014-07-30', 7.9, '[{"name":"Chris Pratt","character":"Peter Quill","profilePath":"/cRH6HPAQ98PlOwwEvhYO4CM9lwu.jpg"},{"name":"Zoe Saldaña","character":"Gamora","profilePath":"/fCJuIn1PMUQtYdRRSnnoZeMJVWs.jpg"},{"name":"Dave Bautista","character":"Drax","profilePath":"/snk6JiXOOoRjPtHU5VMoy6qbd32.jpg"},{"name":"Vin Diesel","character":"Groot (voice)","profilePath":"/nZdVry7lnUkE24PnXakok9okvL4.jpg"},{"name":"Bradley Cooper","character":"Rocket (voice)","profilePath":"/sQq0nft6YZmJ7EMQwPcbaxym3AL.jpg"},{"name":"Lee Pace","character":"Ronan","profilePath":"/eeTc0d2AX1vFYVxZ6Qw7qZpg4Tz.jpg"},{"name":"Michael Rooker","character":"Yondu Udonta","profilePath":"/ngOuHNIAGrKyY1O7F0f9C5Q9ONg.jpg"},{"name":"Karen Gillan","character":"Nebula","profilePath":"/qYx8CflXVq48nGKX1IJsDrAj0sT.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/118340-guardians-of-the-galaxy/watch?locale=IN'),
  ('GG2', 283995, 'movie', 'Anyone can save the galaxy once.', 'The Guardians must fight to keep their newfound family together as they unravel the mysteries of Peter Quill''s true parentage.', '/y4MBh0EjBlMuOzv9axM4qJlmhzz.jpg', '/bW93ycPSSi3Hxx1NvlMX5qm2mQu.jpg', '2017-04-25', 7.6, '[{"name":"Chris Pratt","character":"Peter Quill / Star-Lord","profilePath":"/cRH6HPAQ98PlOwwEvhYO4CM9lwu.jpg"},{"name":"Zoe Saldaña","character":"Gamora","profilePath":"/fCJuIn1PMUQtYdRRSnnoZeMJVWs.jpg"},{"name":"Dave Bautista","character":"Drax","profilePath":"/snk6JiXOOoRjPtHU5VMoy6qbd32.jpg"},{"name":"Vin Diesel","character":"Baby Groot (voice)","profilePath":"/nZdVry7lnUkE24PnXakok9okvL4.jpg"},{"name":"Bradley Cooper","character":"Rocket (voice)","profilePath":"/sQq0nft6YZmJ7EMQwPcbaxym3AL.jpg"},{"name":"Kurt Russell","character":"Ego","profilePath":"/6g1d98oH4miG4k0ZiZWmF3Dt0bO.jpg"},{"name":"Michael Rooker","character":"Yondu","profilePath":"/ngOuHNIAGrKyY1O7F0f9C5Q9ONg.jpg"},{"name":"Karen Gillan","character":"Nebula","profilePath":"/qYx8CflXVq48nGKX1IJsDrAj0sT.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/283995-guardians-of-the-galaxy-vol-2/watch?locale=IN'),
  ('AV2', 99861, 'movie', 'A new age has come.', 'When Tony Stark tries to jumpstart a dormant peacekeeping program, things go awry and Earth’s Mightiest Heroes are put to the ultimate test as the fate of the planet hangs in the balance. As the villainous Ultron emerges, it is up to The Avengers to stop him from enacting his terrible plans, and soon uneasy alliances and unexpected action pave the way for an epic and unique global adventure.', '/4ssDuvEDkSArWEdyBl2X5EHvYKU.jpg', '/kIBK5SKwgqIIuRKhhWrJn3XkbPq.jpg', '2015-04-22', 7.3, '[{"name":"Robert Downey Jr.","character":"Tony Stark / Iron Man","profilePath":"/5qHNjhtjMD4YWH3UP0rm4tKwxCL.jpg"},{"name":"Chris Hemsworth","character":"Thor","profilePath":"/piQGdoIQOF3C1EI5cbYZLAW1gfj.jpg"},{"name":"Mark Ruffalo","character":"Bruce Banner / Hulk","profilePath":"/5GilHMOt5PAQh6rlUKZzGmaKEI7.jpg"},{"name":"Chris Evans","character":"Steve Rogers / Captain America","profilePath":"/3bOGNsHlrswhyW79uvIHH1V43JI.jpg"},{"name":"Scarlett Johansson","character":"Natasha Romanoff / Black Widow","profilePath":"/druW5adKddizHNSoPbI0q7Mvn0K.jpg"},{"name":"Jeremy Renner","character":"Clint Barton / Hawkeye","profilePath":"/yB84D1neTYXfWBaV0QOE9RF2VCu.jpg"},{"name":"James Spader","character":"Ultron (voice)","profilePath":"/uET0mbf2bMkUXbRb1Oxi8Qjqcw3.jpg"},{"name":"Samuel L. Jackson","character":"Nick Fury","profilePath":"/qdfRtvPCj51C9Uy5VEgjgj69JyV.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/99861-avengers-age-of-ultron/watch?locale=IN'),
  ('AM1', 102899, 'movie', 'Heroes don''t get any bigger.', 'Armed with the astonishing ability to shrink in scale but increase in strength, master thief Scott Lang must embrace his inner-hero and help his mentor, Doctor Hank Pym, protect the secret behind his spectacular Ant-Man suit from a new generation of towering threats. Against seemingly insurmountable obstacles, Pym and Lang must plan and pull off a heist that will save the world.', '/rQRnQfUl3kfp78nCWq8Ks04vnq1.jpg', '/1K3JmSNUN8OpjYsCjc0Hy0SYxAb.jpg', '2015-07-14', 7.1, '[{"name":"Paul Rudd","character":"Scott Lang / Ant-Man","profilePath":"/6jtwNOLKy0LdsRAKwZqgYMAfd5n.jpg"},{"name":"Michael Douglas","character":"Dr. Hank Pym","profilePath":"/kVYGPIZowzXLEQfAGUNOqKjAbBb.jpg"},{"name":"Evangeline Lilly","character":"Hope van Dyne","profilePath":"/zgztLIWTJZm3vjGU7ezhF8GXESJ.jpg"},{"name":"Corey Stoll","character":"Darren Cross / Yellowjacket","profilePath":"/a5wxOBGmXVwcEqWvEizFk06SDSj.jpg"},{"name":"Bobby Cannavale","character":"Paxton","profilePath":"/wlp20ggyNI7x0xGUtTjC2Xl2XmD.jpg"},{"name":"Anthony Mackie","character":"Sam Wilson / Falcon","profilePath":"/eZSIDrtTzhvabyjrmIITQLsjx8h.jpg"},{"name":"Judy Greer","character":"Maggie Lang","profilePath":"/pTLjIjh83R424RGxIfq4U0yx947.jpg"},{"name":"Abby Ryder Fortson","character":"Cassie Lang","profilePath":"/DPIxORe7Sco6xVIKVbIsHlRYCI.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/102899-ant-man/watch?locale=IN'),
  ('CA3', 271110, 'movie', 'United we stand. Divided we fall.', 'Following the events of Age of Ultron, the collective governments of the world pass an act designed to regulate all superhuman activity. This polarizes opinion amongst the Avengers, causing two factions to side with Iron Man or Captain America, which causes an epic battle between former allies.', '/rAGiXaUfPzY7CDEyNKUofk3Kw2e.jpg', '/wdwcOBMkt3zmPQuEMxB3FUtMio2.jpg', '2016-04-27', 7.5, '[{"name":"Chris Evans","character":"Steve Rogers / Captain America","profilePath":"/3bOGNsHlrswhyW79uvIHH1V43JI.jpg"},{"name":"Robert Downey Jr.","character":"Tony Stark / Iron Man","profilePath":"/5qHNjhtjMD4YWH3UP0rm4tKwxCL.jpg"},{"name":"Scarlett Johansson","character":"Natasha Romanoff / Black Widow","profilePath":"/druW5adKddizHNSoPbI0q7Mvn0K.jpg"},{"name":"Sebastian Stan","character":"Bucky Barnes / Winter Soldier","profilePath":"/v20RLWst39klatsqUgSrwHxhwee.jpg"},{"name":"Anthony Mackie","character":"Sam Wilson / Falcon","profilePath":"/eZSIDrtTzhvabyjrmIITQLsjx8h.jpg"},{"name":"Don Cheadle","character":"Lieutenant James Rhodes / War Machine","profilePath":"/umhTmcVF26qZKEpSfG1ZNpcbs9D.jpg"},{"name":"Jeremy Renner","character":"Clint Barton / Hawkeye","profilePath":"/yB84D1neTYXfWBaV0QOE9RF2VCu.jpg"},{"name":"Chadwick Boseman","character":"T''Challa / Black Panther","profilePath":"/nL16SKfyP1b7Hk6LsuWiqMfbdb8.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/271110-captain-america-civil-war/watch?locale=IN'),
  ('BW', 497698, 'movie', 'Her world. Her secrets. Her legacy.', 'Natasha Romanoff, also known as Black Widow, confronts the darker parts of her ledger when a dangerous conspiracy with ties to her past arises. Pursued by a force that will stop at nothing to bring her down, Natasha must deal with her history as a spy and the broken relationships left in her wake long before she became an Avenger.', '/qAZ0pzat24kLdO3o8ejmbLxyOac.jpg', '/6azpBJGcLx9SKif8h9VMnflBfa.jpg', '2021-07-07', 7.2, '[{"name":"Scarlett Johansson","character":"Natasha Romanoff / Black Widow","profilePath":"/druW5adKddizHNSoPbI0q7Mvn0K.jpg"},{"name":"Florence Pugh","character":"Yelena Belova","profilePath":"/1Uvfh7xL4U2evkhs0M3C7BbBYFf.jpg"},{"name":"Rachel Weisz","character":"Melina","profilePath":"/9tfHL5tholha1YF6bSKt422ETPM.jpg"},{"name":"David Harbour","character":"Alexei","profilePath":"/qMFtMWlYVtFVyBoBhX5IoA5sN5a.jpg"},{"name":"Ray Winstone","character":"Dreykov","profilePath":"/eSRgAC98u5hQroeZzDeRf60XE21.jpg"},{"name":"Ever Anderson","character":"Young Natasha","profilePath":"/uyf2YlKOyrbfxyw0K5EJbzorF72.jpg"},{"name":"Violet McGraw","character":"Young Yelena","profilePath":"/zxY8BRNRYUFikW2DOHxBK2yiQZb.jpg"},{"name":"O-T Fagbenle","character":"Mason","profilePath":"/baIiZBDYpYXfG4SlonbcqyYg6l.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/497698-black-widow/watch?locale=IN'),
  ('BP1', 284054, 'movie', 'Long live the king.', 'King T''Challa returns home to the reclusive, technologically advanced African nation of Wakanda to serve as his country''s new leader. However, T''Challa soon finds that he is challenged for the throne by factions within his own country as well as without. Using powers reserved to Wakandan kings, T''Challa assumes the Black Panther mantle to join with ex-girlfriend Nakia, the queen-mother, his princess-kid sister, members of the Dora Milaje (the Wakandan ''special forces'') and an American secret agent, to prevent Wakanda from being dragged into a world war.', '/uxzzxijgPIY7slzFvMotPv8wjKA.jpg', '/b6ZJZHUdMEFECvGiDpJjlfUWela.jpg', '2018-02-13', 7.4, '[{"name":"Chadwick Boseman","character":"T''Challa / Black Panther","profilePath":"/nL16SKfyP1b7Hk6LsuWiqMfbdb8.jpg"},{"name":"Michael B. Jordan","character":"Erik Killmonger","profilePath":"/sMBpav8cK7t7Nk0yf4tuNOqNUyW.jpg"},{"name":"Lupita Nyong''o","character":"Nakia","profilePath":"/y40Wu1T742kynOqtwXASc5Qgm49.jpg"},{"name":"Danai Gurira","character":"Okoye","profilePath":"/z7H7QeQvr24vskGlANQhG43vozQ.jpg"},{"name":"Martin Freeman","character":"Everett K. Ross","profilePath":"/nrO54AzrxiNgCjBUOSz6ebyxDZY.jpg"},{"name":"Daniel Kaluuya","character":"W''Kabi","profilePath":"/jj2kZqJobjom36wlhlYhc38nTwN.jpg"},{"name":"Letitia Wright","character":"Shuri","profilePath":"/f7PevpEeBqwzACPhoZ8K3ktrKvE.jpg"},{"name":"Winston Duke","character":"M''Baku","profilePath":"/MhBiZbryibwuoEtPL9Ns8pYHC1.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/284054-black-panther/watch?locale=IN'),
  ('SM1', 315635, 'movie', 'Homework can wait. The city can''t.', 'Following the events of Captain America: Civil War, Peter Parker, with the help of his mentor Tony Stark, tries to balance his life as an ordinary high school student in Queens, New York City, with fighting crime as his superhero alter ego Spider-Man as a new threat, the Vulture, emerges.', '/c24sv2weTHPsmDa7jEMN0m2P3RT.jpg', '/fn4n6uOYcB6Uh89nbNPoU2w80RV.jpg', '2017-07-05', 7.3, '[{"name":"Tom Holland","character":"Peter Parker / Spider-Man","profilePath":"/xKBAaPIa1c7tzZD3Y0MhBLv4hPE.jpg"},{"name":"Michael Keaton","character":"Adrian Toomes / Vulture","profilePath":"/tYSja1KByFnZ4Hkp3stPqkKHnNL.jpg"},{"name":"Robert Downey Jr.","character":"Tony Stark / Iron Man","profilePath":"/5qHNjhtjMD4YWH3UP0rm4tKwxCL.jpg"},{"name":"Marisa Tomei","character":"May Parker","profilePath":"/1cT8wWwGX5jEeGAgjydjb5EwnZF.jpg"},{"name":"Jon Favreau","character":"Happy Hogan","profilePath":"/8MtRRnEHaBSw8Ztdl8saXiw1egP.jpg"},{"name":"Gwyneth Paltrow","character":"Pepper Potts","profilePath":"/x040uB0CDrHjVAUSONw8bbWMvDC.jpg"},{"name":"Zendaya","character":"Michelle","profilePath":"/3WdOloHpjtjL96uVOhFRRCcYSwq.jpg"},{"name":"Donald Glover","character":"Aaron Davis","profilePath":"/jqVkQfeeEmdga1G0jpBwwXXwwSK.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/315635-spider-man-homecoming/watch?locale=IN'),
  ('DS1', 284052, 'movie', 'The impossibilities are endless.', 'After his career is destroyed, a brilliant but arrogant surgeon gets a new lease on life when a sorcerer takes him under her wing and trains him to defend the world against evil.', '/uGBVj3bEbCoZbDjjl9wTxcygko1.jpg', '/kkoiH8ZWxJ9WSAjOadGtuHUQxbm.jpg', '2016-10-25', 7.4, '[{"name":"Benedict Cumberbatch","character":"Dr. Stephen Strange","profilePath":"/wz3MRiMmoz6b5X3oSzMRC9nLxY1.jpg"},{"name":"Chiwetel Ejiofor","character":"Mordo","profilePath":"/kq5DDnqqofoRI0t6ddtRlsJnNPT.jpg"},{"name":"Rachel McAdams","character":"Dr. Christine Palmer","profilePath":"/2DPh6KoNg0p57vvGc6N468zr3ct.jpg"},{"name":"Benedict Wong","character":"Wong","profilePath":"/yYfLyrC2CE6vBWSJfkpuVKL2POM.jpg"},{"name":"Mads Mikkelsen","character":"Kaecilius","profilePath":"/AsX4bdvZ8UCayWTmAf9lAqOA8V7.jpg"},{"name":"Tilda Swinton","character":"The Ancient One","profilePath":"/dzjT4LKgs7eOma84GsPy78DsGNH.jpg"},{"name":"Michael Stuhlbarg","character":"Dr. Nicodemus West","profilePath":"/aYB3SQm3h6ZyAdlbGyiNfakjx56.jpg"},{"name":"Benjamin Bratt","character":"Jonathan Pangborn","profilePath":"/hBenHPT4iJEG2kt5z2TOGnkRZwh.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/284052-doctor-strange/watch?locale=IN'),
  ('TH3', 284053, 'movie', 'No hammer. No problem.', 'Thor is imprisoned on the other side of the universe and finds himself in a race against time to get back to Asgard to stop Ragnarok, the destruction of his home-world and the end of Asgardian civilization, at the hands of a powerful new threat, the ruthless Hela.', '/rzRwTcFvttcN1ZpX2xv4j3tSdJu.jpg', '/vLmHH8jAy8Jq8uBsLucd3592WGh.jpg', '2017-10-02', 7.6, '[{"name":"Chris Hemsworth","character":"Thor","profilePath":"/piQGdoIQOF3C1EI5cbYZLAW1gfj.jpg"},{"name":"Mark Ruffalo","character":"Bruce Banner / Hulk","profilePath":"/5GilHMOt5PAQh6rlUKZzGmaKEI7.jpg"},{"name":"Tom Hiddleston","character":"Loki","profilePath":"/mclHxMm8aPlCPKptP67257F5GPo.jpg"},{"name":"Cate Blanchett","character":"Hela","profilePath":"/vUuEHiAR0eD3XEJhg2DWIjymUAA.jpg"},{"name":"Idris Elba","character":"Heimdall","profilePath":"/be1bVF7qGX91a6c5WeRPs5pKXln.jpg"},{"name":"Jeff Goldblum","character":"Grandmaster","profilePath":"/kcyEPgYtBP5Pm6LLeLGfXKjYovL.jpg"},{"name":"Tessa Thompson","character":"Valkyrie","profilePath":"/19ze60jXlb2j7dXc2UpA3MujXA8.jpg"},{"name":"Karl Urban","character":"Skurge","profilePath":"/7Y96dAfg0HcFrcLjlD5eD9N0uj4.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/284053-thor-ragnarok/watch?locale=IN'),
  ('AM2', 363088, 'movie', 'Real heroes. Not actual size.', 'Just when his time under house arrest is about to end, Scott Lang once again puts his freedom at risk to help Hope van Dyne and Dr. Hank Pym dive into the quantum realm and try to accomplish, against time and any chance of success, a very dangerous rescue mission.', '/cFQEO687n1K6umXbInzocxcnAQz.jpg', '/iYdgEUE2W2aJkgqfSjf1x3gFfuV.jpg', '2018-07-04', 6.9, '[{"name":"Paul Rudd","character":"Scott Lang / Ant-Man","profilePath":"/6jtwNOLKy0LdsRAKwZqgYMAfd5n.jpg"},{"name":"Evangeline Lilly","character":"Hope Van Dyne / Wasp","profilePath":"/zgztLIWTJZm3vjGU7ezhF8GXESJ.jpg"},{"name":"Michael Douglas","character":"Dr. Hank Pym","profilePath":"/kVYGPIZowzXLEQfAGUNOqKjAbBb.jpg"},{"name":"Hannah John-Kamen","character":"Ava / Ghost","profilePath":"/V8P9EVelewGVXbuyEylqrzF6iG.jpg"},{"name":"Randall Park","character":"Jimmy Woo","profilePath":"/u1QpbjVIKegk79DJG9HFmg9Ljv4.jpg"},{"name":"Michelle Pfeiffer","character":"Janet Van Dyne / Wasp","profilePath":"/8qwNMFzmM3BxGKIj1iIqiHHBpx3.jpg"},{"name":"Laurence Fishburne","character":"Dr. Bill Foster","profilePath":"/2GbXERENPpl5MmlqOLlPVaVtifD.jpg"},{"name":"Michael Peña","character":"Luis","profilePath":"/afs4PCiwn8LR93a10drULLVeVLo.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/363088-ant-man-and-the-wasp/watch?locale=IN'),
  ('INH', 68716, 'tv', null, 'After the Royal Family of Inhumans is splintered by a military coup, they barely escape to Hawaii where their surprising interactions with the lush world and humanity around them may prove to not only save them, but Earth itself.', '/zKfGip55oJ9tdzhyd9ayGyFFhuo.jpg', '/5W9YCPMDF5TCudct2guf6b8iRFz.jpg', '2017-09-29', 5.8, '[{"name":"Anson Mount","character":"Blackagar Boltagon / Black Bolt","profilePath":"/A4YBdwnzJKRcZXfodjT4UalHOK9.jpg"},{"name":"Serinda Swan","character":"Medusalith Amaquelin / Medusa","profilePath":"/wVjTGPIvCGEQmSq5dr9fj1RbUHG.jpg"},{"name":"Iwan Rheon","character":"Maximus Boltagon","profilePath":"/xF8bGBL6nUYH9QrXAbah1VQIHU4.jpg"},{"name":"Isabelle Cornish","character":"Crystalia Amaquelin / Crystal","profilePath":"/4TLBrFQ7NDPuKBE7uk11Ji9l9dx.jpg"},{"name":"Ken Leung","character":"Karnak Mander-Azur / Karnak","profilePath":"/hpatUP6u74gkpDRmn9voNY9V43O.jpg"},{"name":"Eme Ikwuakor","character":"Gorgon Petragon / Gorgon","profilePath":"/uKuIc0GznLWnavgDO8KUMYwkgyS.jpg"},{"name":"Sonya Balmores","character":"Auran","profilePath":"/knbho01kwkNbm5pEcCEMCcgnRQd.jpg"},{"name":"Ellen Woglom","character":"Louise","profilePath":"/nL9viX6kRne4DdZLOhLVoG5BRQO.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/68716-marvel-s-inhumans/watch?locale=IN'),
  ('AV3', 299536, 'movie', 'Destiny arrives all the same.', 'As the Avengers and their allies have continued to protect the world from threats too large for any one hero to handle, a new danger has emerged from the cosmic shadows: Thanos. A despot of intergalactic infamy, his goal is to collect all six Infinity Stones, artifacts of unimaginable power, and use them to inflict his twisted will on all of reality. Everything the Avengers have fought for has led up to this moment - the fate of Earth and existence itself has never been more uncertain.', '/7WsyChQLEftFiDOVTGkv3hFpyyt.jpg', '/mDfJG3LC3Dqb67AZ52x3Z0jU0uB.jpg', '2018-04-25', 8.2, '[{"name":"Robert Downey Jr.","character":"Tony Stark / Iron Man","profilePath":"/5qHNjhtjMD4YWH3UP0rm4tKwxCL.jpg"},{"name":"Chris Evans","character":"Steve Rogers / Captain America","profilePath":"/3bOGNsHlrswhyW79uvIHH1V43JI.jpg"},{"name":"Chris Hemsworth","character":"Thor","profilePath":"/piQGdoIQOF3C1EI5cbYZLAW1gfj.jpg"},{"name":"Josh Brolin","character":"Thanos","profilePath":"/sX2etBbIkxRaCsATyw5ZpOVMPTD.jpg"},{"name":"Mark Ruffalo","character":"Bruce Banner / Hulk","profilePath":"/5GilHMOt5PAQh6rlUKZzGmaKEI7.jpg"},{"name":"Scarlett Johansson","character":"Natasha Romanoff / Black Widow","profilePath":"/druW5adKddizHNSoPbI0q7Mvn0K.jpg"},{"name":"Don Cheadle","character":"James Rhodes / War Machine","profilePath":"/umhTmcVF26qZKEpSfG1ZNpcbs9D.jpg"},{"name":"Benedict Cumberbatch","character":"Doctor Strange","profilePath":"/wz3MRiMmoz6b5X3oSzMRC9nLxY1.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/299536-avengers-infinity-war/watch?locale=IN'),
  ('AV4', 299534, 'movie', 'Avenge the fallen.', 'After the devastating events of Avengers: Infinity War, the universe is in ruins due to the efforts of the Mad Titan, Thanos. With the help of remaining allies, the Avengers must assemble once more in order to undo Thanos'' actions and restore order to the universe once and for all, no matter what consequences may be in store.', '/ulzhLuWrPK07P1YkdWQLZnQh1JL.jpg', '/91iy9F1JOG1dvM6M6JNYgvScZpK.jpg', '2019-04-24', 8.2, '[{"name":"Robert Downey Jr.","character":"Tony Stark / Iron Man","profilePath":"/5qHNjhtjMD4YWH3UP0rm4tKwxCL.jpg"},{"name":"Chris Evans","character":"Steve Rogers / Captain America","profilePath":"/3bOGNsHlrswhyW79uvIHH1V43JI.jpg"},{"name":"Mark Ruffalo","character":"Bruce Banner / Hulk","profilePath":"/5GilHMOt5PAQh6rlUKZzGmaKEI7.jpg"},{"name":"Chris Hemsworth","character":"Thor","profilePath":"/piQGdoIQOF3C1EI5cbYZLAW1gfj.jpg"},{"name":"Scarlett Johansson","character":"Natasha Romanoff / Black Widow","profilePath":"/druW5adKddizHNSoPbI0q7Mvn0K.jpg"},{"name":"Jeremy Renner","character":"Clint Barton / Hawkeye","profilePath":"/yB84D1neTYXfWBaV0QOE9RF2VCu.jpg"},{"name":"Josh Brolin","character":"Thanos","profilePath":"/sX2etBbIkxRaCsATyw5ZpOVMPTD.jpg"},{"name":"Don Cheadle","character":"James Rhodes / War Machine","profilePath":"/umhTmcVF26qZKEpSfG1ZNpcbs9D.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/299534-avengers-endgame/watch?locale=IN'),
  ('SM2', 429617, 'movie', 'It''s time to step up.', 'Peter Parker and his friends go on a summer trip to Europe. However, they will hardly be able to rest - Peter will have to agree to help Nick Fury uncover the mystery of creatures that cause natural disasters and destruction throughout the continent.', '/4q2NNj4S5dG2RLF9CpXsej7yXl.jpg', '/vamhMTvh9m9zFHDoR0v1nRtf6T4.jpg', '2019-06-28', 7.4, '[{"name":"Tom Holland","character":"Peter Parker / Spider-Man","profilePath":"/xKBAaPIa1c7tzZD3Y0MhBLv4hPE.jpg"},{"name":"Jake Gyllenhaal","character":"Quentin Beck / Mysterio","profilePath":"/ct2Gh2sJSxd4yaMrSsqSt1HpIC3.jpg"},{"name":"Samuel L. Jackson","character":"Nick Fury","profilePath":"/qdfRtvPCj51C9Uy5VEgjgj69JyV.jpg"},{"name":"Marisa Tomei","character":"May Parker","profilePath":"/1cT8wWwGX5jEeGAgjydjb5EwnZF.jpg"},{"name":"Jon Favreau","character":"Happy Hogan","profilePath":"/8MtRRnEHaBSw8Ztdl8saXiw1egP.jpg"},{"name":"Zendaya","character":"MJ","profilePath":"/3WdOloHpjtjL96uVOhFRRCcYSwq.jpg"},{"name":"Jacob Batalon","character":"Ned Leeds","profilePath":"/53YhaL4xw4Sb1ssoHkeSSBaO29c.jpg"},{"name":"Tony Revolori","character":"Flash Thompson","profilePath":"/tSF6XmXDikrKZbFUeoDnafXxKjT.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/429617-spider-man-far-from-home/watch?locale=IN'),
  ('FWS', 88396, 'tv', 'Honor the shield.', 'Following the events of “Avengers: Endgame”, the Falcon, Sam Wilson and the Winter Soldier, Bucky Barnes team up in a global adventure that tests their abilities, and their patience.', '/6kbAMLteGO8yyewYau6bJ683sw7.jpg', '/aTjbqMONy77fHJrIYu14g1F0d5h.jpg', '2021-03-19', 7.6, '[{"name":"Anthony Mackie","character":"Sam Wilson / Falcon","profilePath":"/eZSIDrtTzhvabyjrmIITQLsjx8h.jpg"},{"name":"Sebastian Stan","character":"Bucky Barnes / Winter Soldier","profilePath":"/v20RLWst39klatsqUgSrwHxhwee.jpg"},{"name":"Wyatt Russell","character":"John Walker","profilePath":"/zIldBzXdBWskPZB7x35G2hYEVDo.jpg"},{"name":"Erin Kellyman","character":"Karli Morgenthau","profilePath":"/ngTdJIcwZ9YsyvXIR5PUzv9plwV.jpg"},{"name":"Daniel Brühl","character":"Baron Zemo","profilePath":"/3YlmTfiy5qZXkrdKGjaM1uMjGKP.jpg"},{"name":"Emily VanCamp","character":"Sharon Carter","profilePath":"/zTl2KVglr7D7jnBLjbqe1BbbJiV.jpg"},{"name":"Danny Ramirez","character":"Joaquin Torres","profilePath":"/7ZvcfWA5O5ULiupbHZtGGEPwnpI.jpg"},{"name":"Adepero Oduye","character":"Sarah Wilson","profilePath":"/w9axk9dSTVpZPnoDH08iClklmF4.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/88396-the-falcon-and-the-winter-soldier/watch?locale=IN'),
  ('WV', 85271, 'tv', 'Experience a new vision of reality.', 'Wanda Maximoff and Vision—two super-powered beings living idealized suburban lives—begin to suspect that everything is not as it seems.', '/ijWWwINc8h71NQ8j1LTJMFSj5wr.jpg', '/lOr9NKxh4vMweufMOUDJjJhCRHW.jpg', '2021-01-15', 8.2, '[{"name":"Elizabeth Olsen","character":"Wanda Maximoff / Scarlet Witch","profilePath":"/wIU675y4dofIDVuhaNWPizJNtep.jpg"},{"name":"Paul Bettany","character":"Vision / The Vision","profilePath":"/vcAVrAOZrpqmi37qjFdztRAv1u9.jpg"},{"name":"Kathryn Hahn","character":"Agnes / Agatha Harkness","profilePath":"/9sVllAKfEls3SJD3GoPm2JEZoa5.jpg"},{"name":"Teyonah Parris","character":"Monica Rambeau / Geraldine","profilePath":"/iGvBTOi0y2fbBVwgnBRXgY0IXDY.jpg"},{"name":"Randall Park","character":"Jimmy Woo","profilePath":"/u1QpbjVIKegk79DJG9HFmg9Ljv4.jpg"},{"name":"Kat Dennings","character":"Darcy Lewis / The Escape Artist","profilePath":"/nJHGtedRCIeAdysg18oJngUZmL3.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/85271-wandavision/watch?locale=IN'),
  ('SC', 566525, 'movie', 'You can''t outrun your destiny.', 'Shang-Chi must confront the past he thought he left behind when he is drawn into the web of the mysterious Ten Rings organization.', '/9f2Q0U3IOsLgrI2HkvldwSABZy5.jpg', '/r7K6Xt0RX4Mw0cAbZVw5cyb1Tux.jpg', '2021-09-01', 7.5, '[{"name":"Simu Liu","character":"Shaun / Shang-Chi","profilePath":"/cCx2OghLj9KN73oyRZe92i2p3Ih.jpg"},{"name":"Tony Leung Chiu-wai","character":"Xu Wenwu","profilePath":"/nQbSQAws5BdakPEB5MtiqWVeaMV.jpg"},{"name":"Awkwafina","character":"Katy","profilePath":"/l5AKkg3H1QhMuXmTTmq1EyjyiRb.jpg"},{"name":"Ben Kingsley","character":"Trevor Slattery","profilePath":"/k3Dmu49B2akwDvgqy52MOxznI59.jpg"},{"name":"Zhang Meng''er","character":"Xialing","profilePath":"/lOJ0EIjNybCDT6J3ZLMDnqpoDXD.jpg"},{"name":"Fala Chen","character":"Li","profilePath":"/nsucfzPlPHeYVXhIS2b8ZtKr4wJ.jpg"},{"name":"Michelle Yeoh","character":"Ying Nan","profilePath":"/i6fHvGt7Rb8oVyjjdQVV6vEHB94.jpg"},{"name":"Yuen Wah","character":"Master Guang Bo","profilePath":"/50iChkgIJI7ZmPUjCpYKfEsXBnf.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/566525-shang-chi-and-the-legend-of-the-ten-rings/watch?locale=IN'),
  ('ET', 524434, 'movie', 'In the beginning...', 'The Eternals are a team of ancient aliens who have been living on Earth in secret for thousands of years. When an unexpected tragedy forces them out of the shadows, they are forced to reunite against mankind’s most ancient enemy, the Deviants.', '/lFByFSLV5WDJEv3KabbdAF959F2.jpg', '/c6H7Z4u73ir3cIoCteuhJh7UCAR.jpg', '2021-11-03', 6.8, '[{"name":"Gemma Chan","character":"Sersi","profilePath":"/stTKj4iNauhqlVmZ6XAsFsvcMCY.jpg"},{"name":"Richard Madden","character":"Ikaris","profilePath":"/9QQFfVZ6PLe3WVmOL56wGNOnbGL.jpg"},{"name":"Angelina Jolie","character":"Thena","profilePath":"/bXNxIKcJ5cNNW8QFrBPWcfTSu9x.jpg"},{"name":"Salma Hayek Pinault","character":"Ajak","profilePath":"/1qfYF7NGRObmeKR7IVXUFVIC0CN.jpg"},{"name":"Kumail Nanjiani","character":"Kingo","profilePath":"/9EyrK1Cv7ey1h1GgmsVAOn45w6G.jpg"},{"name":"Lia McHugh","character":"Sprite","profilePath":"/vPnN8xBLsm5vMZvMpRBNJ5WuAdl.jpg"},{"name":"Brian Tyree Henry","character":"Phastos","profilePath":"/2MsJh0bpyzwvOUnXOltHp3j85Pb.jpg"},{"name":"Lauren Ridloff","character":"Makkari","profilePath":"/eyMriacYFsWtdgzedVPfXmT0TFa.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/524434-eternals/watch?locale=IN'),
  ('LK1', 84958, 'tv', 'Loki''s time has come.', 'After stealing the Tesseract during the events of “Avengers: Endgame,” an alternate version of Loki is brought to the mysterious Time Variance Authority, a bureaucratic organization that exists outside of time and space and monitors the timeline. They give Loki a choice: face being erased from existence due to being a “time variant” or help fix the timeline and stop a greater threat.', '/rX1wQMTKFqF0gvZyS0DDQqgnQPB.jpg', '/q3jHCb4dMfYF6ojikKuHd6LscxC.jpg', '2021-06-09', 8.2, '[{"name":"Tom Hiddleston","character":"Loki Laufeyson","profilePath":"/mclHxMm8aPlCPKptP67257F5GPo.jpg"},{"name":"Sophia Di Martino","character":"Sylvie / The Variant","profilePath":"/qZdFp18btpQJfDoknxr7DgfRpcB.jpg"},{"name":"Wunmi Mosaku","character":"Hunter B-15","profilePath":"/vp7qDA7cYZj0MDYk1k4wysmznnN.jpg"},{"name":"Eugene Cordero","character":"Casey / Hunter K-5E","profilePath":"/waruLSR8lXBjhAFL0J6ihuVY62d.jpg"},{"name":"Ke Huy Quan","character":"Ouroboros ''OB''","profilePath":"/iestHyn7PLuVowj5Jaa1SGPboQ4.jpg"},{"name":"Owen Wilson","character":"Mobius M. Mobius","profilePath":"/5A46lNOwmpX77jAdhyKxU7e2Hub.jpg"},{"name":"Gugu Mbatha-Raw","character":"Ravonna Renslayer","profilePath":"/sHAnv0kw5JHzWBOP7gAezwqgl8J.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/84958-loki/watch?locale=IN'),
