  ('MZ', 138505, 'tv', 'Who will save us from our heroes?', 'After the Avengers are overtaken by a zombie plague, a desperate group of survivors discover the key to bringing an end to the super-powered undead, racing across a dystopian landscape and risking life and limb to save their world.', '/mwKj9ERGFXsWot0nXgQ5yMQf9I7.jpg', '/lxQMxqao3vs2ehxESrkQU6acU86.jpg', '2025-09-24', 7.3, '[{"name":"Iman Vellani","character":"Kamala Khan (voice)","profilePath":"/oBpOjLAH8heYNNJZN1Z5jVQhAKC.jpg"},{"name":"Todd Williams","character":"Blade Knight (voice)","profilePath":"/uLdgH4w3wT348vdgUE06kSMizlZ.jpg"},{"name":"David Harbour","character":"Alexei Shostakov / Red Guardian (voice)","profilePath":"/qMFtMWlYVtFVyBoBhX5IoA5sN5a.jpg"},{"name":"Simu Liu","character":"Shang-Chi (voice)","profilePath":"/cCx2OghLj9KN73oyRZe92i2p3Ih.jpg"},{"name":"Awkwafina","character":"Katy Chen (voice)","profilePath":"/l5AKkg3H1QhMuXmTTmq1EyjyiRb.jpg"},{"name":"Elizabeth Olsen","character":"Wanda Maximoff / The Red Queen (voice)","profilePath":"/wIU675y4dofIDVuhaNWPizJNtep.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/138505-marvel-zombies/watch?locale=IN'),
  ('SM3', 634649, 'movie', 'Enter the Multiverse.', 'Peter Parker is unmasked and no longer able to separate his normal life from the high-stakes of being a super-hero. When he asks for help from Doctor Strange the stakes become even more dangerous, forcing him to discover what it truly means to be Spider-Man.', '/1g0dhYtq4irTY1GPXvft6k4YLjm.jpg', '/14QbnygCuTO0vl7CAFmPf1fgZfV.jpg', '2021-12-15', 7.9, '[{"name":"Tom Holland","character":"Peter Parker / Spider-Man","profilePath":"/xKBAaPIa1c7tzZD3Y0MhBLv4hPE.jpg"},{"name":"Zendaya","character":"MJ","profilePath":"/3WdOloHpjtjL96uVOhFRRCcYSwq.jpg"},{"name":"Benedict Cumberbatch","character":"Doctor Strange","profilePath":"/wz3MRiMmoz6b5X3oSzMRC9nLxY1.jpg"},{"name":"Jacob Batalon","character":"Ned Leeds","profilePath":"/53YhaL4xw4Sb1ssoHkeSSBaO29c.jpg"},{"name":"Jon Favreau","character":"Happy Hogan","profilePath":"/8MtRRnEHaBSw8Ztdl8saXiw1egP.jpg"},{"name":"Jamie Foxx","character":"Max Dillon / Electro","profilePath":"/zD8Nsy4Xrghp7WunwpCj5JKBPeU.jpg"},{"name":"Willem Dafoe","character":"Norman Osborn / Green Goblin","profilePath":"/ui8e4sgZAwMPi3hzEO53jyBJF9B.jpg"},{"name":"Alfred Molina","character":"Dr. Otto Octavius / Doc Ock","profilePath":"/nJo91Czesn6z0d0pkfbDoVZY3sg.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/634649-spider-man-no-way-home/watch?locale=IN'),
  ('HWK', 88329, 'tv', 'This holiday season, the best gifts come with a bow.', 'Former Avenger Clint Barton has a seemingly simple mission: get back to his family for Christmas. Possible? Maybe with the help of Kate Bishop, a 22-year-old archer with dreams of becoming a superhero. The two are forced to work together when a presence from Barton’s past threatens to derail far more than the festive spirit.', '/ct5pNE5dDHryHLDnxyZPYcqO1sz.jpg', '/9QNv2Al3GfCND8BwuLmu2GwVht7.jpg', '2021-11-24', 7.8, '[{"name":"Jeremy Renner","character":"Clint Barton / Hawkeye","profilePath":"/yB84D1neTYXfWBaV0QOE9RF2VCu.jpg"},{"name":"Hailee Steinfeld","character":"Kate Bishop","profilePath":"/qDInsG0cxWNxS1X4t59TBZ5S6x5.jpg"},{"name":"Tony Dalton","character":"Jack Duquesne","profilePath":"/vWteTJu9Dyrax7gQq8ndTjx5s6V.jpg"},{"name":"Alaqua Cox","character":"Maya Lopez","profilePath":"/gvIuoDFjWTQe8WwhU5CZ6qAQCuT.jpg"},{"name":"Fra Fee","character":"Kazimierz ''Kazi'' Kazimierczak","profilePath":"/1UnZxfqaRTpoqpafM9PEAvlHAc7.jpg"},{"name":"Aleks Paunovic","character":"Ivan","profilePath":"/k8j9Nr0xS2vEUMV8Wl0y5cC2NeB.jpg"},{"name":"Piotr Adamczyk","character":"Tomas","profilePath":"/sOhY6yYAP0IgnCweTpjhxQ659Qt.jpg"},{"name":"Vera Farmiga","character":"Eleanor Bishop","profilePath":"/5Vs7huBmTKftwlsc2BPAntyaQYj.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/88329-hawkeye/watch?locale=IN'),
  ('MK', 92749, 'tv', 'Embrace the chaos.', 'When Steven Grant, a mild-mannered gift-shop employee, becomes plagued with blackouts and memories of another life, he discovers he has dissociative identity disorder and shares a body with mercenary Marc Spector. As Steven/Marc’s enemies converge upon them, they must navigate their complex identities while thrust into a deadly mystery among the powerful gods of Egypt.', '/x6FsYvt33846IQnDSFxla9j0RX8.jpg', '/iux1vKPT7Vw1AzetZb4Jz6wfYsm.jpg', '2022-03-30', 7.6, '[{"name":"Oscar Isaac","character":"Marc Spector / Steven Grant / Moon Knight / Mr. Knight","profilePath":"/dW5U5yrIIPmMjRThR9KT2xH6nTz.jpg"},{"name":"Ethan Hawke","character":"Arthur Harrow","profilePath":"/oojD9jSshvUT4t6AUySsBxoekHk.jpg"},{"name":"May Calamawy","character":"Layla El-Faouly","profilePath":"/5S3nNkH5p85xK7k7AaXBZ0ouyOR.jpg"},{"name":"Ann Akinjirin","character":"Bobbi","profilePath":"/o4Tbudvow3rzgxmlilnRral5fpr.jpg"},{"name":"David Ganly","character":"Billy","profilePath":"/e9NUAspQ306cmyhkl3gG5LU1LHi.jpg"},{"name":"Karim El Hakim","character":"Khonshu Performer","profilePath":"/2K3iP4pm6RFZ29kQxjXZQl40hCF.jpg"},{"name":"F. Murray Abraham","character":"Khonshu (voice)","profilePath":"/p2RYVGdrcP0m70BkkiKcwyrDeim.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/92749-moon-knight/watch?locale=IN'),
  ('MSM', 92782, 'tv', 'The future is in her hands.', 'A great student, avid gamer, and voracious fan-fic scribe, Kamala Khan has a special affinity for superheroes, particularly Captain Marvel. However, she struggles to fit in at home and at school — that is, until she gets superpowers like the heroes she’s always looked up to. Life is easier with superpowers, right?', '/3HWWh92kZbD7odwJX7nKmXNZsYo.jpg', '/mfcLUWASJghU8MTNK38eYktfE83.jpg', '2022-06-08', 6.3, '[{"name":"Iman Vellani","character":"Kamala Khan","profilePath":"/oBpOjLAH8heYNNJZN1Z5jVQhAKC.jpg"},{"name":"Matt Lintz","character":"Bruno","profilePath":"/oeOU0Hdwt6UCIiRILU1plMAq7VA.jpg"},{"name":"Yasmeen Fletcher","character":"Nakia","profilePath":"/dlFwMUnYiO4TqdlnDjA7cHEfWoh.jpg"},{"name":"Zenobia Shroff","character":"Muneeba","profilePath":"/fwU2vIUq9W9eXRKxx9r3papdOkS.jpg"},{"name":"Mohan Kapur","character":"Yusuf","profilePath":"/lL0J5DBOwN1pwLCvuo7uQ0ApjF.jpg"},{"name":"Saagar Shaikh","character":"Aamir","profilePath":"/hQsNsaJ8ekAHjJfkxfQPpH0qX5Q.jpg"},{"name":"Rish Shah","character":"Kamran","profilePath":"/mxk7ArOC6QjtGitmLDqLvJn6Ra6.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/92782-ms-marvel/watch?locale=IN'),
  ('DS2', 453395, 'movie', 'Enter a new dimension of Strange.', 'Doctor Strange, with the help of mystical allies both old and new, traverses the mind-bending and dangerous alternate realities of the Multiverse to confront a mysterious new adversary.', '/ddJcSKbcp4rKZTmuyWaMhuwcfMz.jpg', '/lv3TXqhpaIxkclIHbhN2MRMOemQ.jpg', '2022-05-04', 7.2, '[{"name":"Benedict Cumberbatch","character":"Doctor Stephen Strange","profilePath":"/wz3MRiMmoz6b5X3oSzMRC9nLxY1.jpg"},{"name":"Xochitl Gomez","character":"America Chavez","profilePath":"/q39DOx44YHrGF1h88R9HxRNZS3.jpg"},{"name":"Elizabeth Olsen","character":"Wanda Maximoff / The Scarlet Witch","profilePath":"/wIU675y4dofIDVuhaNWPizJNtep.jpg"},{"name":"Chiwetel Ejiofor","character":"Baron Mordo","profilePath":"/kq5DDnqqofoRI0t6ddtRlsJnNPT.jpg"},{"name":"Benedict Wong","character":"Wong","profilePath":"/yYfLyrC2CE6vBWSJfkpuVKL2POM.jpg"},{"name":"Rachel McAdams","character":"Dr. Christine Palmer","profilePath":"/2DPh6KoNg0p57vvGc6N468zr3ct.jpg"},{"name":"Jett Klyne","character":"Tommy Maximoff","profilePath":"/6F7fGR6iQFzKNFfHCCYZbg82Alk.jpg"},{"name":"Julian Hilliard","character":"Billy Maximoff","profilePath":"/lp1IJliBZb9OFP5KK09HjSGOsau.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/453395-doctor-strange-in-the-multiverse-of-madness/watch?locale=IN'),
  ('TH4', 616037, 'movie', 'The one is not the only.', 'After his retirement is interrupted by Gorr the God Butcher, a galactic killer who seeks the extinction of the gods, Thor Odinson enlists the help of King Valkyrie, Korg, and ex-girlfriend Jane Foster, who now wields Mjolnir as the Mighty Thor. Together they embark upon a harrowing cosmic adventure to uncover the mystery of the God Butcher’s vengeance and stop him before it’s too late.', '/pIkRyD18kl4FhoCNQuWxWu5cBLM.jpg', '/jsoz1HlxczSuTx0mDl2h0lxy36l.jpg', '2022-07-06', 6.4, '[{"name":"Chris Hemsworth","character":"Thor","profilePath":"/piQGdoIQOF3C1EI5cbYZLAW1gfj.jpg"},{"name":"Natalie Portman","character":"Jane Foster / The Mighty Thor","profilePath":"/edPU5HxncLWa1YkgRPNkSd68ONG.jpg"},{"name":"Christian Bale","character":"Gorr","profilePath":"/7Pxez9J8fuPd2Mn9kex13YALrCQ.jpg"},{"name":"Tessa Thompson","character":"King Valkyrie","profilePath":"/19ze60jXlb2j7dXc2UpA3MujXA8.jpg"},{"name":"Taika Waititi","character":"Korg / Old Kronan God (voice)","profilePath":"/ww6L2ksfJNMbuiIdDuvVKndUHsv.jpg"},{"name":"Russell Crowe","character":"Zeus","profilePath":"/uxiXuVH4vNWrKlJMVVPG1sxAJFe.jpg"},{"name":"Jaimie Alexander","character":"Sif","profilePath":"/21IQHPAXNUHiqPrpIYr4X8h2wmf.jpg"},{"name":"Idris Elba","character":"Heimdall","profilePath":"/be1bVF7qGX91a6c5WeRPs5pKXln.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/616037-thor-love-and-thunder/watch?locale=IN'),
  ('SHK', 92783, 'tv', 'You''ll like her when she''s angry.', 'Jennifer Walters navigates the complicated life of a single, 30-something attorney who also happens to be a green 6-foot-7-inch superpowered hulk.', '/5xz2orV8f0usyrfGNshcoXHmiaV.jpg', '/eljErfkQUcFUgQkI4I1soZcH8MW.jpg', '2022-08-18', 6.1, '[{"name":"Tatiana Maslany","character":"Jennifer Walters / She-Hulk","profilePath":"/x8lBkm9CBJbIlLpqjEwkQydZ2or.jpg"},{"name":"Ginger Gonzaga","character":"Nikki Ramos","profilePath":"/4YMXflYscHwrDBrrPfWEndwyNsB.jpg"},{"name":"Jameela Jamil","character":"Mary MacPherran / Titania","profilePath":"/e9RviCItpPoSwD79y4YYlDbIwM6.jpg"},{"name":"Renée Elise Goldsberry","character":"Mallory Book","profilePath":"/xlcw1r2ieUlaDLK6CIs5MQ9HIgK.jpg"},{"name":"Josh Segarra","character":"Augustus ''Pug'' Pugliese","profilePath":"/vXhukEBgpI8jmCUCSGcpJCNzXHV.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/92783-she-hulk-attorney-at-law/watch?locale=IN'),
  ('WBN', 894205, 'movie', 'There''s no escaping the night.', 'On a dark and somber night, a secret cabal of monster hunters emerge from the shadows and gather at the foreboding Bloodstone Temple following the death of their leader. In a strange and macabre memorial to the leader’s life, the attendees are thrust into a mysterious and deadly competition for a powerful relic—a hunt that will ultimately bring them face to face with a dangerous monster.', '/mvIvNKRIJPPS7WSFarFhOAGIVnU.jpg', '/pfAZP7JvTTxqgq7n6A1OYgkAdEW.jpg', '2022-09-25', 7, '[{"name":"Gael García Bernal","character":"Jack Russell","profilePath":"/7uEO29wtdyY9bjt2JN43gVpE6vt.jpg"},{"name":"Laura Donnelly","character":"Elsa Bloodstone","profilePath":"/xunYtWPWYwzLhaScz0bFz4WjFbW.jpg"},{"name":"Harriet Sansom Harris","character":"Verussa Bloodstone","profilePath":"/1ShvYCWkZycAGb27ZivGrLx1PhS.jpg"},{"name":"Kirk R. Thatcher","character":"Jovan","profilePath":"/7rkO6MLFgcPzbLV4mpwLu2r6M3S.jpg"},{"name":"Eugenie Bondurant","character":"Azarel","profilePath":"/9ULAELEKNha7VCJhRWoer58NcJe.jpg"},{"name":"Leonardo Nam","character":"Liorn","profilePath":"/yKL70EoAdjJV2JI2CN1Dr5qzAlJ.jpg"},{"name":"Daniel J. Watts","character":"Barasso","profilePath":"/yzsburXAHWg7XOvWeBtYNnm5giD.jpg"},{"name":"Al Hamacher","character":"Billy Swan","profilePath":"/u5QxguVAJDIkF8npPvpxjRjJ7Ft.jpg"}]'::jsonb, null),
  ('BP2', 505642, 'movie', 'Forever.', 'Queen Ramonda, Shuri, M’Baku, Okoye and the Dora Milaje fight to protect their nation from intervening world powers in the wake of King T’Challa’s death.  As the Wakandans strive to embrace their next chapter, the heroes must band together with the help of War Dog Nakia and Everett Ross and forge a new path for the kingdom of Wakanda.', '/sv1xJUazXeYqALzczSZ3O6nkH75.jpg', '/83H0C66AcvkwpG2738VCTHMY9uv.jpg', '2022-11-09', 7, '[{"name":"Letitia Wright","character":"Shuri","profilePath":"/f7PevpEeBqwzACPhoZ8K3ktrKvE.jpg"},{"name":"Tenoch Huerta Mejía","character":"Namor","profilePath":"/x0Wy85CZu887ZQMWrjj4vVulczM.jpg"},{"name":"Lupita Nyong''o","character":"Nakia","profilePath":"/y40Wu1T742kynOqtwXASc5Qgm49.jpg"},{"name":"Danai Gurira","character":"Okoye","profilePath":"/z7H7QeQvr24vskGlANQhG43vozQ.jpg"},{"name":"Winston Duke","character":"M''Baku","profilePath":"/MhBiZbryibwuoEtPL9Ns8pYHC1.jpg"},{"name":"Angela Bassett","character":"Ramonda","profilePath":"/tKnuviliyeKNGlo26IU5gIrJAtd.jpg"},{"name":"Martin Freeman","character":"Everett Ross","profilePath":"/nrO54AzrxiNgCjBUOSz6ebyxDZY.jpg"},{"name":"Julia Louis-Dreyfus","character":"Valentina Allegra de Fontaine","profilePath":"/iEfHQNrVbVFesDPjdySom9nqsFg.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/505642-black-panther-wakanda-forever/watch?locale=IN'),
  ('GHS', 774752, 'movie', 'The perfect present is a galaxy away.', 'On a mission to make Christmas unforgettable for Quill, the Guardians head to Earth in search of the perfect present.', '/8dqXyslZ2hv49Oiob9UjlGSHSTR.jpg', '/rfnmMYuZ6EKOBvQLp2wqP21v7sI.jpg', '2022-11-24', 7.1, '[{"name":"Chris Pratt","character":"Peter Quill / Star-Lord","profilePath":"/cRH6HPAQ98PlOwwEvhYO4CM9lwu.jpg"},{"name":"Dave Bautista","character":"Drax","profilePath":"/snk6JiXOOoRjPtHU5VMoy6qbd32.jpg"},{"name":"Karen Gillan","character":"Nebula","profilePath":"/qYx8CflXVq48nGKX1IJsDrAj0sT.jpg"},{"name":"Pom Klementieff","character":"Mantis","profilePath":"/hfUKAI2kXTMMWjno0i4sLPJud5N.jpg"},{"name":"Vin Diesel","character":"Groot (voice)","profilePath":"/nZdVry7lnUkE24PnXakok9okvL4.jpg"},{"name":"Bradley Cooper","character":"Rocket (voice)","profilePath":"/sQq0nft6YZmJ7EMQwPcbaxym3AL.jpg"},{"name":"Sean Gunn","character":"Kraglin","profilePath":"/tiolBlPytndQVGHO9vLnBKWWenq.jpg"},{"name":"Rhett Miller","character":"Bzermikitokolok","profilePath":"/pu1pcZBbkq43qxECHi3YzbZfLnn.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/774752-the-guardians-of-the-galaxy-holiday-special/watch?locale=IN'),
  ('SI', 114472, 'tv', 'Who do you trust?', 'Nick Fury and Talos discover a faction of shapeshifting Skrulls who have been infiltrating Earth for years.', '/3rINdUPSy9AklJg74jWHOyUXuZd.jpg', '/6mOK9j99OFlxGc3ird2jWUeUha9.jpg', '2023-06-21', 6.5, '[{"name":"Samuel L. Jackson","character":"Nick Fury","profilePath":"/qdfRtvPCj51C9Uy5VEgjgj69JyV.jpg"},{"name":"Ben Mendelsohn","character":"Talos","profilePath":"/pA9mu9D2IolVA0v2Yo0tJm6uUyI.jpg"},{"name":"Kingsley Ben-Adir","character":"Gravik","profilePath":"/yCJNGOQKavWqOZSIEPKvQVlyAwA.jpg"},{"name":"Killian Scott","character":"Pagon","profilePath":"/8ri6qJgCitrezFaiCPzgQbdDBYp.jpg"},{"name":"Samuel Adewunmi","character":"Beto","profilePath":"/j3Q9JlpO6HKUlEiDtWOTSnr5Prj.jpg"},{"name":"Dermot Mulroney","character":"President Ritson","profilePath":"/kkrMKD6b4vEdphVgKsenRY4NgiC.jpg"},{"name":"Emilia Clarke","character":"G''iah","profilePath":"/iFY6t7Ux9r70WB7Sp0TTVz6eGtm.jpg"},{"name":"Olivia Colman","character":"Sonya Falsworth","profilePath":"/lawJUdbLb1YW0niaYjiVGR9IBG8.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/114472-secret-invasion/watch?locale=IN'),
  ('MRV', 609681, 'movie', 'Higher. Further. Faster. Together.', 'When her duties send her to an anomalous wormhole linked to a Kree revolutionary, Carol''s powers become entangled with that of Jersey City super-fan Kamala Khan, aka Ms. Marvel, and Carol''s estranged niece, now S.A.B.E.R. astronaut Captain Monica Rambeau. Together, this unlikely trio must team up and learn to work in concert to save the universe.', '/9GBhzXMFjgcZ3FdR9w3bUMMTps5.jpg', '/feSiISwgEpVzR1v3zv2n2AU4ANJ.jpg', '2023-11-08', 5.9, '[{"name":"Brie Larson","character":"Carol Danvers / Captain Marvel","profilePath":"/iqZ5uKJWbwSITCK4CqdlUHZTnXD.jpg"},{"name":"Teyonah Parris","character":"Monica Rambeau","profilePath":"/iGvBTOi0y2fbBVwgnBRXgY0IXDY.jpg"},{"name":"Iman Vellani","character":"Kamala Khan / Ms. Marvel","profilePath":"/oBpOjLAH8heYNNJZN1Z5jVQhAKC.jpg"},{"name":"Samuel L. Jackson","character":"Nick Fury","profilePath":"/qdfRtvPCj51C9Uy5VEgjgj69JyV.jpg"},{"name":"Zawe Ashton","character":"Dar-Benn","profilePath":"/zbxVfvhPhCfgpgmWTdtHWurNqYu.jpg"},{"name":"Gary Lewis","character":"Emperor Dro''ge","profilePath":"/cOaibfAluUeWPtcSOjedfGXn9ym.jpg"},{"name":"Park Seo-jun","character":"Prince Yan","profilePath":"/k1ALgZkOApYt7PIUBkUitmknXQC.jpg"},{"name":"Zenobia Shroff","character":"Muneeba Khan","profilePath":"/fwU2vIUq9W9eXRKxx9r3papdOkS.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/609681-the-marvels/watch?locale=IN'),
  ('AM3', 640146, 'movie', 'Witness the beginning of a new dynasty.', 'Super-Hero partners Scott Lang and Hope van Dyne, along with with Hope''s parents Janet van Dyne and Hank Pym, and Scott''s daughter Cassie Lang, find themselves exploring the Quantum Realm, interacting with strange new creatures and embarking on an adventure that will push them beyond the limits of what they thought possible.', '/qnqGbB22YJ7dSs4o6M7exTpNxPz.jpg', '/m8JTwHFwX7I7JY5fPe4SjqejWag.jpg', '2023-02-15', 6.2, '[{"name":"Paul Rudd","character":"Scott Lang / Ant-Man","profilePath":"/6jtwNOLKy0LdsRAKwZqgYMAfd5n.jpg"},{"name":"Evangeline Lilly","character":"Hope Van Dyne / The Wasp","profilePath":"/zgztLIWTJZm3vjGU7ezhF8GXESJ.jpg"},{"name":"Michael Douglas","character":"Dr. Hank Pym","profilePath":"/kVYGPIZowzXLEQfAGUNOqKjAbBb.jpg"},{"name":"Michelle Pfeiffer","character":"Janet Van Dyne","profilePath":"/8qwNMFzmM3BxGKIj1iIqiHHBpx3.jpg"},{"name":"Jonathan Majors","character":"Kang the Conqueror","profilePath":"/nsxnMbkl9Lpc12AmYwKi9SmsJ7e.jpg"},{"name":"Kathryn Newton","character":"Cassie Lang","profilePath":"/26OEa0uS8552sVJakaCEHYvqOao.jpg"},{"name":"Corey Stoll","character":"M.O.D.O.K.","profilePath":"/a5wxOBGmXVwcEqWvEizFk06SDSj.jpg"},{"name":"Bill Murray","character":"Lord Krylar","profilePath":"/nnCsJc9x3ZiG3AFyiyc3FPehppy.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/640146-ant-man-and-the-wasp-quantumania/watch?locale=IN'),
  ('GG3', 447365, 'movie', 'Once more with feeling.', 'Peter Quill, still reeling from the loss of Gamora, must rally his team around him to defend the universe along with protecting one of their own. A mission that, if not completed successfully, could quite possibly lead to the end of the Guardians as we know them.', '/r2J02Z2OpNTctfOSN1Ydgii51I3.jpg', '/5YZbUmjbMa3ClvSW1Wj3D6XGolb.jpg', '2023-05-03', 7.9, '[{"name":"Chris Pratt","character":"Peter Quill / Star-Lord","profilePath":"/cRH6HPAQ98PlOwwEvhYO4CM9lwu.jpg"},{"name":"Zoe Saldaña","character":"Gamora","profilePath":"/fCJuIn1PMUQtYdRRSnnoZeMJVWs.jpg"},{"name":"Dave Bautista","character":"Drax","profilePath":"/snk6JiXOOoRjPtHU5VMoy6qbd32.jpg"},{"name":"Karen Gillan","character":"Nebula","profilePath":"/qYx8CflXVq48nGKX1IJsDrAj0sT.jpg"},{"name":"Pom Klementieff","character":"Mantis","profilePath":"/hfUKAI2kXTMMWjno0i4sLPJud5N.jpg"},{"name":"Vin Diesel","character":"Groot (voice)","profilePath":"/nZdVry7lnUkE24PnXakok9okvL4.jpg"},{"name":"Bradley Cooper","character":"Rocket (voice)","profilePath":"/sQq0nft6YZmJ7EMQwPcbaxym3AL.jpg"},{"name":"Sean Gunn","character":"Kraglin / Young Rocket (voice)","profilePath":"/tiolBlPytndQVGHO9vLnBKWWenq.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/447365-guardians-of-the-galaxy-vol-3/watch?locale=IN'),
