  ('WM', 198178, 'tv', 'He was born to play this role, but the spotlight reveals everything.', 'Simon and Trevor, two actors at opposite ends of their careers, chase life-changing roles.', '/6yy9nQlFt2l6UVWzrfhszFCaZ5C.jpg', '/ldz9THIHaV4orMsUrPT1nlQF51T.jpg', '2026-01-27', 7, '[{"name":"Yahya Abdul-Mateen II","character":"Simon Williams","profilePath":"/79VdVjUoiYGcgjOT9UmE5XIpoZM.jpg"},{"name":"Arian Moayed","character":"Agent Cleary","profilePath":"/hYBqwt0HelUqgKSd1VDUAyvfDME.jpg"},{"name":"X Mayo","character":"Janelle Jackson","profilePath":"/7rmo3N6EOzsKxvlk78NJLjEboys.jpg"},{"name":"Ben Kingsley","character":"Trevor Slattery","profilePath":"/k3Dmu49B2akwDvgqy52MOxznI59.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/198178-wonder-man/watch?locale=IN'),
  ('FF4', 617126, 'movie', 'Welcome to the family.', 'Against the vibrant backdrop of a 1960s-inspired, retro-futuristic world, Marvel''s First Family is forced to balance their roles as heroes with the strength of their family bond, while defending Earth from a ravenous space god called Galactus and his enigmatic Herald, Silver Surfer.', '/nf5qaSEvyYSNeFH0YhSs5EsBLX9.jpg', '/s94NjfKkcSczZ1FembwmQZwsuwY.jpg', '2025-07-23', 7, '[{"name":"Pedro Pascal","character":"Reed Richards / Mister Fantastic","profilePath":"/oKcMbVn0NJTNzQt0ClKKvVXkm60.jpg"},{"name":"Vanessa Kirby","character":"Sue Storm / Invisible Woman","profilePath":"/tViEEsjvbhrJxWsOipUqIYjdHEb.jpg"},{"name":"Ebon Moss-Bachrach","character":"Ben Grimm / The Thing","profilePath":"/xD8GVNayMpiTZxLfahy2DseYcQq.jpg"},{"name":"Joseph Quinn","character":"Johnny Storm / Human Torch","profilePath":"/zshhuioZaH8S5ZKdMcojzWi1ntl.jpg"},{"name":"Ralph Ineson","character":"Galactus","profilePath":"/sn3ONJw2pJxMHiCqPwvkaiWr5mc.jpg"},{"name":"Julia Garner","character":"Shalla-Bal / Silver Surfer","profilePath":"/gpLpOBoHz5VF1IZhfWQNqJvDTWp.jpg"},{"name":"Paul Walter Hauser","character":"Harvey Elder / Mole Man","profilePath":"/hXjjbYg1Ah8mFf5ZcaakyXzDKMx.jpg"},{"name":"Natasha Lyonne","character":"Rachel Rozman","profilePath":"/2QJoTBEIeYyjGSDot9qxv2ayPH3.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/617126-the-fantastic-4-first-steps/watch?locale=IN'),
  ('XFC', 49538, 'movie', 'Witness the moment that will change our world.', 'Before Charles Xavier and Erik Lensherr took the names Professor X and Magneto, they were two young men discovering their powers for the first time. Before they were arch-enemies, they were closest of friends, working together with other mutants (some familiar, some new), to stop the greatest threat the world has ever known.', '/hNEokmUke0dazoBhttFN0o3L7Xv.jpg', '/yhp5Pt4GugkCs5mz63qWz5khHXe.jpg', '2011-06-01', 7.3, '[{"name":"James McAvoy","character":"Charles Xavier","profilePath":"/u4REKbm3zhFI2J5tVyqRovGRYUJ.jpg"},{"name":"Michael Fassbender","character":"Erik Lehnsherr","profilePath":"/xvbnUiB2ZBR3QIt595OzNy657Vw.jpg"},{"name":"Jennifer Lawrence","character":"Raven / Mystique","profilePath":"/6WTY6HjXMGxnHilJRVC3eLnu43F.jpg"},{"name":"Rose Byrne","character":"Moira MacTaggert","profilePath":"/wR8YZlrewVW2FixRBrJcxaXU3R1.jpg"},{"name":"Kevin Bacon","character":"Sebastian Shaw","profilePath":"/rjX2Oz3tCZMfSwOoIAyEhdtXnTE.jpg"},{"name":"January Jones","character":"Emma Frost","profilePath":"/9HYdabnECNzUPG9QcO9qLnZZG8h.jpg"},{"name":"Nicholas Hoult","character":"Hank / Beast","profilePath":"/pXm8GWTm9eIA8pUGOjvmYjlxamu.jpg"},{"name":"Lucas Till","character":"Alex Summers / Havok","profilePath":"/5m8xgsOgT3FgCBo2AsMn7dewe57.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/49538-x-men-first-class/watch?locale=IN'),
  ('XDF', 127585, 'movie', 'To save the future, they must alter the past.', 'The ultimate X-Men ensemble fights a war for the survival of the species across two time periods as they join forces with their younger selves in an epic battle that must change the past – to save our future.', '/tYfijzolzgoMOtegh1Y7j2Enorg.jpg', '/3czpqXzFy5UcNuD1AubecRLWkwD.jpg', '2014-05-15', 7.5, '[{"name":"Hugh Jackman","character":"Logan / Wolverine","profilePath":"/4Xujtewxqt6aU0Y81tsS9gkjizk.jpg"},{"name":"James McAvoy","character":"Charles Xavier","profilePath":"/u4REKbm3zhFI2J5tVyqRovGRYUJ.jpg"},{"name":"Michael Fassbender","character":"Erik Lehnsherr","profilePath":"/xvbnUiB2ZBR3QIt595OzNy657Vw.jpg"},{"name":"Patrick Stewart","character":"Professor X","profilePath":"/ufqtnLh3JJjPbEgxEag3MM5nZyv.jpg"},{"name":"Ian McKellen","character":"Magneto","profilePath":"/5cnnnpnJG6TiYUSS7qgJheUZgnv.jpg"},{"name":"Jennifer Lawrence","character":"Raven / Mystique","profilePath":"/6WTY6HjXMGxnHilJRVC3eLnu43F.jpg"},{"name":"Halle Berry","character":"Storm","profilePath":"/84HRDZodRCuBSpYGSc3ow8WucI4.jpg"},{"name":"Nicholas Hoult","character":"Hank / Beast","profilePath":"/pXm8GWTm9eIA8pUGOjvmYjlxamu.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/127585-x-men-days-of-future-past/watch?locale=IN'),
  ('XAP', 246655, 'movie', 'Only the strong will survive.', 'After the re-emergence of the world''s first mutant, world-destroyer Apocalypse, the X-Men must unite to defeat his extinction level plan.', '/ikA8UhYdTGpqbatFa93nIf6noSr.jpg', '/sTQNRqLbfCXolrb5CizAW1dj528.jpg', '2016-05-18', 6.5, '[{"name":"James McAvoy","character":"Professor Charles Xavier","profilePath":"/u4REKbm3zhFI2J5tVyqRovGRYUJ.jpg"},{"name":"Michael Fassbender","character":"Erik Lehnsherr / Magneto","profilePath":"/xvbnUiB2ZBR3QIt595OzNy657Vw.jpg"},{"name":"Jennifer Lawrence","character":"Raven / Mystique","profilePath":"/6WTY6HjXMGxnHilJRVC3eLnu43F.jpg"},{"name":"Nicholas Hoult","character":"Hank McCoy / Beast","profilePath":"/pXm8GWTm9eIA8pUGOjvmYjlxamu.jpg"},{"name":"Oscar Isaac","character":"En Sabah Nur / Apocalypse","profilePath":"/dW5U5yrIIPmMjRThR9KT2xH6nTz.jpg"},{"name":"Rose Byrne","character":"Moira MacTaggert","profilePath":"/wR8YZlrewVW2FixRBrJcxaXU3R1.jpg"},{"name":"Evan Peters","character":"Peter Maximoff / Quicksilver","profilePath":"/m9okq20ca2Md38i2ekJeKs3vTwa.jpg"},{"name":"Josh Helman","character":"Col. William Stryker","profilePath":"/1thwLjrgvFv7ifjyVtTKQh23OCh.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/246655-x-men-apocalypse/watch?locale=IN'),
  ('XDP', 320288, 'movie', 'A Phoenix will rise. The X-Men will fall.', 'The X-Men face their most formidable and powerful foe when one of their own, Jean Grey, starts to spiral out of control. During a rescue mission in outer space, Jean is nearly killed when she''s hit by a mysterious cosmic force. Once she returns home, this force not only makes her infinitely more powerful, but far more unstable. The X-Men must now band together to save her soul and battle aliens that want to use Grey''s new abilities to rule the galaxy.', '/cCTJPelKGLhALq3r51A9uMonxKj.jpg', '/cjRUhKyt2Jo3V1KNzc5tpPNfccG.jpg', '2019-06-05', 6, '[{"name":"Sophie Turner","character":"Jean Grey / Dark Phoenix","profilePath":"/8ur4aHFakVCinWk0cvrGO8qAUhv.jpg"},{"name":"James McAvoy","character":"Charles Xavier / Professor X","profilePath":"/u4REKbm3zhFI2J5tVyqRovGRYUJ.jpg"},{"name":"Nicholas Hoult","character":"Hank McCoy / Beast","profilePath":"/pXm8GWTm9eIA8pUGOjvmYjlxamu.jpg"},{"name":"Tye Sheridan","character":"Scott Summers / Cyclops","profilePath":"/d5ZS2fjqC98cIGkhEGX0fRYhku4.jpg"},{"name":"Michael Fassbender","character":"Erik Lensherr / Magneto","profilePath":"/xvbnUiB2ZBR3QIt595OzNy657Vw.jpg"},{"name":"Alexandra Shipp","character":"Ororo Munroe / Storm","profilePath":"/98AfO5NSqWnlhIxjSg08gGYdxUG.jpg"},{"name":"Evan Peters","character":"Peter Maximoff / Quicksilver","profilePath":"/m9okq20ca2Md38i2ekJeKs3vTwa.jpg"},{"name":"Jessica Chastain","character":"Vuk","profilePath":"/eQKnihReJeB9vQEa5gySzAlKfZt.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/320288-dark-phoenix/watch?locale=IN'),
  ('XM1', 36657, 'movie', 'Trust a few. Fear the rest.', 'Two mutants, Rogue and Wolverine, come to a private academy for their kind whose resident superhero team, the X-Men, must oppose a terrorist organization with similar powers.', '/bRDAc4GogyS9ci3ow7UnInOcriN.jpg', '/3QUVzbcNyfGe3ocWkYAT8emK8Co.jpg', '2000-07-13', 7, '[{"name":"Hugh Jackman","character":"Logan / Wolverine","profilePath":"/4Xujtewxqt6aU0Y81tsS9gkjizk.jpg"},{"name":"Patrick Stewart","character":"Xavier","profilePath":"/ufqtnLh3JJjPbEgxEag3MM5nZyv.jpg"},{"name":"Ian McKellen","character":"Magneto","profilePath":"/5cnnnpnJG6TiYUSS7qgJheUZgnv.jpg"},{"name":"Famke Janssen","character":"Jean Grey","profilePath":"/uvZGwNsLqe9NyA57Qlt46IkO8Bd.jpg"},{"name":"James Marsden","character":"Cyclops","profilePath":"/lf7OnfKZnMgNh9b98764tqSocGK.jpg"},{"name":"Halle Berry","character":"Storm","profilePath":"/84HRDZodRCuBSpYGSc3ow8WucI4.jpg"},{"name":"Anna Paquin","character":"Rogue","profilePath":"/5FjBCsn3kujldP8LizoCrc3hsHp.jpg"},{"name":"Tyler Mane","character":"Sabretooth","profilePath":"/3M8oXR5bBsnOJX29SGrQ1vx9L7R.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/36657-x-men/watch?locale=IN'),
  ('XM2', 36658, 'movie', 'The time has come for those who are different to stand united.', 'Professor Charles Xavier and his team of genetically gifted superheroes face a rising tide of anti-mutant sentiment led by Col. William Stryker. Storm, Wolverine and Jean Grey must join Magneto and Mystique to unhinge Stryker''s scheme to exterminate all mutants.', '/bst4alFUXCxISwdRUKSMhhkrX1M.jpg', '/7TYITrR804tLITNur3b8VLCK6tw.jpg', '2003-04-27', 7, '[{"name":"Hugh Jackman","character":"Logan / Wolverine","profilePath":"/4Xujtewxqt6aU0Y81tsS9gkjizk.jpg"},{"name":"Patrick Stewart","character":"Professor Charles Xavier","profilePath":"/ufqtnLh3JJjPbEgxEag3MM5nZyv.jpg"},{"name":"Ian McKellen","character":"Eric Lehnsherr / Magneto","profilePath":"/5cnnnpnJG6TiYUSS7qgJheUZgnv.jpg"},{"name":"James Marsden","character":"Scott Summers / Cyclops","profilePath":"/lf7OnfKZnMgNh9b98764tqSocGK.jpg"},{"name":"Brian Cox","character":"William Stryker","profilePath":"/scSjbFCTRngXlkJRoKptM5kQGw7.jpg"},{"name":"Famke Janssen","character":"Jean Grey","profilePath":"/uvZGwNsLqe9NyA57Qlt46IkO8Bd.jpg"},{"name":"Halle Berry","character":"Ororo Munroe / Storm","profilePath":"/84HRDZodRCuBSpYGSc3ow8WucI4.jpg"},{"name":"Alan Cumming","character":"Kurt Wagner / Nightcrawler","profilePath":"/axil8ufunARfqyU4ceZNh36fkVQ.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/36658-x2/watch?locale=IN'),
  ('XM3', 36668, 'movie', 'Take a stand.', 'When a cure is found to treat mutations, lines are drawn amongst the X-Men led by Professor Charles Xavier, and Magneto''s Brotherhood of Mutants.', '/a2xicU8DpKtRizOHjQLC1JyCSRS.jpg', '/sBl1n4Oi2wX81EtXIb8NsPqJf3W.jpg', '2006-05-24', 6.4, '[{"name":"Hugh Jackman","character":"Logan / Wolverine","profilePath":"/4Xujtewxqt6aU0Y81tsS9gkjizk.jpg"},{"name":"Halle Berry","character":"Ororo Munroe / Storm","profilePath":"/84HRDZodRCuBSpYGSc3ow8WucI4.jpg"},{"name":"Ian McKellen","character":"Erik Lehnsherr / Magneto","profilePath":"/5cnnnpnJG6TiYUSS7qgJheUZgnv.jpg"},{"name":"Patrick Stewart","character":"Professor Charles Xavier","profilePath":"/ufqtnLh3JJjPbEgxEag3MM5nZyv.jpg"},{"name":"Famke Janssen","character":"Jean Grey / Phoenix","profilePath":"/uvZGwNsLqe9NyA57Qlt46IkO8Bd.jpg"},{"name":"Anna Paquin","character":"Marie / Rogue","profilePath":"/5FjBCsn3kujldP8LizoCrc3hsHp.jpg"},{"name":"Kelsey Grammer","character":"Dr. Henry ''Hank'' McCoy / Beast","profilePath":"/5zik4VJim6YTSWDjC7tkp13wxUp.jpg"},{"name":"James Marsden","character":"Scott Summers / Cyclops","profilePath":"/lf7OnfKZnMgNh9b98764tqSocGK.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/36668-x-men-the-last-stand/watch?locale=IN'),
  ('DP1', 293660, 'movie', 'Feel the love.', 'The origin story of former Special Forces operative turned mercenary Wade Wilson, who, after being subjected to a rogue experiment that leaves him with accelerated healing powers, adopts the alter ego Deadpool. Armed with his new abilities and a dark, twisted sense of humor, Deadpool hunts down the man who nearly destroyed his life.', '/3E53WEZJqP6aM84D8CckXx4pIHw.jpg', '/en971MEXui9diirXlogOrPKmsEn.jpg', '2016-02-09', 7.6, '[{"name":"Ryan Reynolds","character":"Wade / Deadpool","profilePath":"/trzgptffGvAlAT6MEu01fz47cLW.jpg"},{"name":"Morena Baccarin","character":"Vanessa","profilePath":"/4gyHyg6FJ1oFczOm5pmMkdEEo2J.jpg"},{"name":"Ed Skrein","character":"Ajax","profilePath":"/btJvbQbWf3ciYM4SM5tMWSJEkXX.jpg"},{"name":"T.J. Miller","character":"Weasel","profilePath":"/rRrVvBxOkyYM5XdLXimShHR1Itn.jpg"},{"name":"Gina Carano","character":"Angel Dust","profilePath":"/6K89PVbt3v2N7cqbPyZiO74yuOj.jpg"},{"name":"Leslie Uggams","character":"Blind Al","profilePath":"/8zQO5GNWQwJG4we5AYfjopblRFe.jpg"},{"name":"Brianna Hildebrand","character":"Negasonic Teenage Warhead","profilePath":"/8lGwV4rMQReWMlsXhLBYMRTYzTA.jpg"},{"name":"Stefan Kapičić","character":"Colossus (voice)","profilePath":"/6qHO7ckiyjLNOmW0v5RZj1MpLBj.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/293660-deadpool/watch?locale=IN'),
  ('XWL', 76170, 'movie', 'When he''s most vulnerable, he''s most dangerous.', 'Wolverine faces his ultimate nemesis - and tests of his physical, emotional, and mortal limits - in a life-changing voyage to modern-day Japan.', '/t2wVAcoRlKvEIVSbiYDb8d0QqqS.jpg', '/bEAQfLTykGg232kJogBlxRYaRqU.jpg', '2013-07-21', 6.4, '[{"name":"Hugh Jackman","character":"Logan / Wolverine","profilePath":"/4Xujtewxqt6aU0Y81tsS9gkjizk.jpg"},{"name":"Hiroyuki Sanada","character":"Shingen Harada / Lord Shingen","profilePath":"/SOwDxhGnRccP2lAtssQ7TxCzOe.jpg"},{"name":"Tao Okamoto","character":"Mariko Yashida / Scarlet Samurai","profilePath":"/ztnb6OVslOSaTILOvGVpUOCY88W.jpg"},{"name":"Rila Fukushima","character":"Yukio / Pinkie Pie","profilePath":"/raklPPc6AZcDnNrjmJu60FHxI2F.jpg"},{"name":"Famke Janssen","character":"Jean Grey / Phoenix","profilePath":"/uvZGwNsLqe9NyA57Qlt46IkO8Bd.jpg"},{"name":"Will Yun Lee","character":"Harada","profilePath":"/zR29E2BHrp6PF7bxD6bVq0nDZXm.jpg"},{"name":"Svetlana Khodchenkova","character":"Madame Hydra / Viper","profilePath":"/xldEh62hTjgxcmJPAyDeBnwKFCg.jpg"},{"name":"Hal Yamanouchi","character":"Ichiro Yashida / Silver Samurai","profilePath":"/xkVp8owZoRHs7hMD6ideMz61B4T.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/76170-the-wolverine/watch?locale=IN'),
  ('DP2', 383498, 'movie', 'Prepare for the Second Coming.', 'Wisecracking mercenary Deadpool battles the evil and powerful Cable and other bad guys to save a boy''s life.', '/to0spRl1CMDvyUbOnbb4fTk3VAd.jpg', '/3P52oz9HPQWxcwHOwxtyrVV1LKi.jpg', '2018-05-15', 7.5, '[{"name":"Ryan Reynolds","character":"Wade Wilson / Deadpool / Juggernaut (voice)","profilePath":"/trzgptffGvAlAT6MEu01fz47cLW.jpg"},{"name":"Josh Brolin","character":"Cable","profilePath":"/sX2etBbIkxRaCsATyw5ZpOVMPTD.jpg"},{"name":"Morena Baccarin","character":"Vanessa","profilePath":"/4gyHyg6FJ1oFczOm5pmMkdEEo2J.jpg"},{"name":"Julian Dennison","character":"Firefist","profilePath":"/zSFwaT2osi7D2G0vFetub4yCDwi.jpg"},{"name":"Zazie Beetz","character":"Domino","profilePath":"/sgxzT54GnvgeMnOZgpQQx9csAdd.jpg"},{"name":"T.J. Miller","character":"Weasel","profilePath":"/rRrVvBxOkyYM5XdLXimShHR1Itn.jpg"},{"name":"Leslie Uggams","character":"Blind Al","profilePath":"/8zQO5GNWQwJG4we5AYfjopblRFe.jpg"},{"name":"Karan Soni","character":"Dopinder","profilePath":"/t3eNrzRKy3wTVCUiEp002UXbjxX.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/383498-deadpool-2/watch?locale=IN'),
  ('LOG', 263115, 'movie', 'Someone has come along.', 'In the near future, a weary Logan cares for an ailing Professor X in a hideout on the Mexican border. But Logan''s attempts to hide from the world and his legacy are upended when a young mutant arrives, pursued by dark forces.', '/fnbjcRDYn6YviCcePDnGdyAkYsB.jpg', '/4DZxWNSAyksN6N3JkvpJ53Yq6zU.jpg', '2017-02-28', 7.8, '[{"name":"Hugh Jackman","character":"Logan / X-24","profilePath":"/4Xujtewxqt6aU0Y81tsS9gkjizk.jpg"},{"name":"Dafne Keen","character":"Laura","profilePath":"/g325OIjIHrFr0te8ewPfhKQ2SKj.jpg"},{"name":"Patrick Stewart","character":"Charles","profilePath":"/ufqtnLh3JJjPbEgxEag3MM5nZyv.jpg"},{"name":"Elizabeth Rodriguez","character":"Gabriela","profilePath":"/9f851DP7NHAOKvvlZdXxYigDYbl.jpg"},{"name":"Boyd Holbrook","character":"Pierce","profilePath":"/xmkpedcct3ey1d1HGDNsUMQPHcB.jpg"},{"name":"Stephen Merchant","character":"Caliban","profilePath":"/6WM2rK6390Nwk398syJbGcPvRct.jpg"},{"name":"Richard E. Grant","character":"Dr. Rice","profilePath":"/720dpCjuN5cEYFn43GwzZqXtpWv.jpg"},{"name":"Stephen Dunlevy","character":"Macon","profilePath":"/e0HDyS2xosZ7ByWFBfRoaw07tE5.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/263115-logan/watch?locale=IN'),
  ('DPW', 533535, 'movie', 'Come together.', 'A listless Wade Wilson toils away in civilian life with his days as the morally flexible mercenary, Deadpool, behind him. But when his homeworld faces an existential threat, Wade must reluctantly suit-up again with an even more reluctant Wolverine.', '/8cdWjvZQUExUUTzyp4t6EDMubfO.jpg', '/by8z9Fe8y7p4jo2YlW2SZDnptyT.jpg', '2024-07-24', 7.6, '[{"name":"Ryan Reynolds","character":"Wade Wilson / Deadpool / Nicepool","profilePath":"/trzgptffGvAlAT6MEu01fz47cLW.jpg"},{"name":"Hugh Jackman","character":"Logan / Wolverine","profilePath":"/4Xujtewxqt6aU0Y81tsS9gkjizk.jpg"},{"name":"Emma Corrin","character":"Cassandra Nova","profilePath":"/miSbXJBlq6S3dVvOr7OoNL4axW6.jpg"},{"name":"Matthew Macfadyen","character":"Mr. Paradox","profilePath":"/sFaIfkykJdftwrc3BdEfpdg2mYW.jpg"},{"name":"Dafne Keen","character":"Laura / X-23","profilePath":"/g325OIjIHrFr0te8ewPfhKQ2SKj.jpg"},{"name":"Jon Favreau","character":"Happy Hogan","profilePath":"/8MtRRnEHaBSw8Ztdl8saXiw1egP.jpg"},{"name":"Morena Baccarin","character":"Vanessa","profilePath":"/4gyHyg6FJ1oFczOm5pmMkdEEo2J.jpg"},{"name":"Rob Delaney","character":"Peter","profilePath":"/xirfT1znRkkughLiPemKu3NhkKQ.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/movie/533535-deadpool-wolverine/watch?locale=IN'),
  ('X97', 138502, 'tv', 'New episodes. New era.', 'The X-Men, a band of mutants who use their uncanny gifts to protect a world that hates and fears them, are challenged like never before, forced to face a dangerous and unexpected new future.', '/2HKBc5UiFw8JrruHq8S1Y7TnlW0.jpg', '/jIyEmnBrZtl6SEWyBoMO2hZnzMa.jpg', '2024-03-20', 8.7, '[]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/138502-x-men-97/watch?locale=IN'),
  ('X98', 138502, 'tv', 'New episodes. New era.', 'The X-Men, a band of mutants who use their uncanny gifts to protect a world that hates and fears them, are challenged like never before, forced to face a dangerous and unexpected new future.', '/2HKBc5UiFw8JrruHq8S1Y7TnlW0.jpg', '/jIyEmnBrZtl6SEWyBoMO2hZnzMa.jpg', '2024-03-20', 8.7, '[]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/138502-x-men-97/watch?locale=IN'),
  ('YF2', 138503, 'tv', 'Meet the new hero on the block.', 'Peter Parker is on his way to becoming a hero, but his path to get there is anything but ordinary.', '/kjcsNeqF52YUQ2rUBGLMHwLkxvR.jpg', '/kkT2B2gmynoh9kZMo1gromLNeqy.jpg', '2025-01-29', 7.8, '[{"name":"Hudson Thames","character":"Peter Parker / Spider-Man (voice)","profilePath":"/7VpYPW62UlqwFhKyhN7tR1olv4X.jpg"}]'::jsonb, 'https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/138503-your-friendly-neighborhood-spider-man/watch?locale=IN'),
  ('SBD', 969681, 'movie', 'A brand new day starts now.', 'Fighting crime full-time as Spider-Man in a world that doesn''t remember him—and the pressure of seeing his old friends move on without him—sparks a change in Peter Parker he may not have the power to control. But that transformation might also be the only thing that can stop a shocking new threat to the city and those he loves - a powerful villain no one can even see.', '/iPOn6DinuVyLY17YM9mKuPofV08.jpg', '/qeQJx07rK2xm8SD2sJxFKhE7gs0.jpg', '2026-07-28', 8, '[{"name":"Tom Holland","character":"Peter Parker / Spider-Man","profilePath":"/xKBAaPIa1c7tzZD3Y0MhBLv4hPE.jpg"},{"name":"Sadie Sink","character":"Jean Grey","profilePath":"/92FddzBfK50XOUbtwjqHPraoGHy.jpg"},{"name":"Tramell Tillman","character":"William ''Bill'' Metzger","profilePath":"/bEA15zMnkcXlRroYjKrFUWiiK7y.jpg"},{"name":"Zendaya","character":"MJ","profilePath":"/3WdOloHpjtjL96uVOhFRRCcYSwq.jpg"},{"name":"Jon Bernthal","character":"Frank Castle / Punisher","profilePath":"/o0t6EVkJOrFAjESDilZUlf46IbQ.jpg"},{"name":"Jacob Batalon","character":"Ned Leeds","profilePath":"/53YhaL4xw4Sb1ssoHkeSSBaO29c.jpg"},{"name":"Mark Ruffalo","character":"Bruce Banner / Hulk","profilePath":"/5GilHMOt5PAQh6rlUKZzGmaKEI7.jpg"},{"name":"Liza Colón-Zayas","character":"Detective Jean DeWolff","profilePath":"/q2gHcef0wckji0AS8ZEO6cYx065.jpg"}]'::jsonb, null),
  ('VQ', 213375, 'tv', null, 'After the events of WandaVision, White Vision struggles to connect with the memories given to him as he lacks the emotions or feelings associated with them.', '/6j60tGRAjBmWRPTOEwhW6oRbPMP.jpg', '/hgo15B8eUnbEjszVV1qdV8sGz9S.jpg', '2026-10-14', null, '[{"name":"Paul Bettany","character":"The Vision","profilePath":"/vcAVrAOZrpqmi37qjFdztRAv1u9.jpg"},{"name":"Henry Lewis","character":"D.U.M.-E","profilePath":"/sMDsMyLYhmI1N1amPPmd6Lrh7UK.jpg"},{"name":"Jonathan Sayer","character":"U","profilePath":"/s7uy8s3sG9AqMOlUuKC74JbKRxP.jpg"},{"name":"James D''Arcy","character":"J.A.R.V.I.S.","profilePath":"/6CInTvBeLwXLx2id9TgaULaVEO4.jpg"},{"name":"Orla Brady","character":"F.R.I.D.A.Y.","profilePath":"/wjo8xposTE0HenFopy6KELCWoD0.jpg"},{"name":"Emily Hampshire","character":"E.D.I.T.H.","profilePath":"/kXb6SAUOACHN9F3M4rkxF7BsJGN.jpg"},{"name":"James Spader","character":"Ultron","profilePath":"/uET0mbf2bMkUXbRb1Oxi8Qjqcw3.jpg"},{"name":"Todd Stashwick","character":"Paladin","profilePath":"/seKRXV2HMS36ip4SfQq6PLRiLL2.jpg"}]'::jsonb, null),
  ('DOM', 1003596, 'movie', null, 'Beloved heroes from three distinct universes are set on a deadly collision course and face an existential threat unlike anything they''ve ever encountered.', '/cWXtJhrlruF8CeYuaBGE8vdj3Q9.jpg', '/s4v0UX1anfXm0UvloLsTTJ4v222.jpg', '2026-12-16', null, '[{"name":"Robert Downey Jr.","character":"Victor von Doom  / Doctor Doom","profilePath":"/5qHNjhtjMD4YWH3UP0rm4tKwxCL.jpg"},{"name":"Chris Evans","character":"Steve Rogers","profilePath":"/3bOGNsHlrswhyW79uvIHH1V43JI.jpg"},{"name":"Chris Hemsworth","character":"Thor","profilePath":"/piQGdoIQOF3C1EI5cbYZLAW1gfj.jpg"},{"name":"Pedro Pascal","character":"Reed Richards / Mister Fantastic","profilePath":"/oKcMbVn0NJTNzQt0ClKKvVXkm60.jpg"},{"name":"Paul Rudd","character":"Scott Lang / Ant-Man","profilePath":"/6jtwNOLKy0LdsRAKwZqgYMAfd5n.jpg"},{"name":"Anthony Mackie","character":"Sam Wilson / Captain America","profilePath":"/eZSIDrtTzhvabyjrmIITQLsjx8h.jpg"},{"name":"Florence Pugh","character":"Yelena Belova","profilePath":"/1Uvfh7xL4U2evkhs0M3C7BbBYFf.jpg"},{"name":"Vanessa Kirby","character":"Sue Storm / Invisible Woman","profilePath":"/tViEEsjvbhrJxWsOipUqIYjdHEb.jpg"}]'::jsonb, null);

insert into public.episode_media (entry_id, episode_index, name, overview,
  still_path, air_date, runtime) values
  ('EOW', 0, 'Into the Lion''s Den', 'A former member of the Dora Milaje is sent to take down a rogue Wakandan known as The Lion.', '/7Ex7F84z8fiJKC8X1juNYX3z1oM.jpg', '2025-08-01', 32),
  ('EOW', 1, 'Legends and Lies', 'Amidst the Trojan War, a soldier attempts to breach the city''s defenses to retrieve an artifact.', '/wjA5EoEmEfacfzrdcJ6JoyNqPFo.jpg', '2025-08-01', 32),
  ('EOW', 2, 'Lost and Found', 'A powerful stowaway infiltrates the Golden City and threatens the secrets kept within.', '/lRKiS5NhEqquh19eySRWgaZU3Oe.jpg', '2025-08-01', 31),
  ('EOW', 3, 'The Last Panther', 'Two Wakandans must choose to complete their mission or defy their homeland and save their world.', '/p7o7jgI2CVKnTS7DMKJ9vmFbzJw.jpg', '2025-08-01', 30),
  ('DD1', 0, 'Into the Ring', 'Murdock''s vigilante crime fighting and his new law practice find equally dangerous challenges in a murder case tied to a corporate crime syndicate.', '/mBrmtpUxuUmYq0e9brRn8n8sdWe.jpg', '2015-04-10', 53),
  ('DD1', 1, 'Cut Man', 'Murdock makes a near fatal error while trying to save a kidnapped boy, and finds an unlikely ally when he needs saving himself.', '/ujNuAv6IkFAkl1JJ1c9VF1VtqUZ.jpg', '2015-04-10', 53),
  ('DD1', 2, 'Rabbit in a Snowstorm', 'Murdock and Foggy take on a mysterious wealthy client, but Murdock is convinced that there''s more to the case than just the facts.', '/j5HVoA9h20qX2VadR5oJiySjZfd.jpg', '2015-04-10', 53),
  ('DD1', 3, 'In the Blood', 'Two vicious Russian brothers working for Fisk strike back against Daredevil. Fisk moves to further consolidate his power in the criminal underworld.', '/a10UVizY2XGABWHMsi5gzGy9VPn.jpg', '2015-04-10', 53),
  ('DD1', 4, 'World on Fire', 'Fisk moves forward with plans that threaten to rip Hell''s Kitchen apart. Murdock and Foggy take on a case helping tenants victimized by a slumlord.', '/vif8R3u4lakvK5GAtXNzpZij9Jo.jpg', '2015-04-10', 56),
  ('DD1', 5, 'Condemned', 'Daredevil finds himself trapped in the fallout of Fisk''s plan to take control of Hell''s Kitchen. Ben Urich digs closer to the truth.', '/iGXrSJkyvCFRvHR8hEYU46xrlON.jpg', '2015-04-10', 49),
  ('DD1', 6, 'Stick', 'An important figure from Murdock''s past reemerges seeking his help to battle a new enemy threatening Hell''s Kitchen.', '/lrWKT1xiihBFrkIOHYPDeEhjuUj.jpg', '2015-04-10', 51),
  ('DD1', 7, 'Shadows in the Glass', 'While Murdock, Foggy and Karen''s mission becomes clearer, Fisk''s world spins further out of control in his battle for Hell''s Kitchen.', '/x0kt6qHldGP8KQzvRyk4VXZ2Bok.jpg', '2015-04-10', 54),
  ('DD1', 8, 'Speak of the Devil', 'When Fisk gains the upper hand, the goal to destroy him becomes even more difficult, while Daredevil faces his own demons.', '/rQTSUqBGlLyY3jmkGhXJpONdcNr.jpg', '2015-04-10', 58),
  ('DD1', 9, 'Nelson v. Murdock', 'Murdock and Foggy''s relationship is put to the ultimate test while a new enemy against Fisk emerges.', '/nNP0eEUkok8kDnRWVM2tV9Zabc1.jpg', '2015-04-10', 57),
  ('DD1', 10, 'The Path of the Righteous', 'Fisk and Murdock wrestle with the consequences of their chosen paths, while Ben and Karen get closer to Fisk''s true past.', '/cQFGj6I6LliVr9EYO7SvrZLbDuR.jpg', '2015-04-10', 59),
  ('DD1', 11, 'The Ones We Leave Behind', 'Fisk seeks revenge while Karen is haunted by recent events. Daredevil makes a startling discovery about Fisk''s financing.', '/nwcmjyS5NPJ9viSqtrQhwoY7I7n.jpg', '2015-04-10', 60),
  ('DD1', 12, 'Daredevil', 'In the season finale, a boxed-in Fisk and a desperate Murdock, Foggy and Karen are forced to play their end games.', '/yW0GkHvNaWJiCZhOrdA0XryeqxO.jpg', '2015-04-10', 56),
  ('JJ1', 0, 'AKA Ladies Night', 'Jessica Jones is hired to find a pretty NYU student who''s vanished, but it turns out to be more than a simple missing persons case.', '/8sdMBGwHYW7UWrPv8c39w7VHj83.jpg', '2015-11-20', 53),
  ('JJ1', 1, 'AKA Crush Syndrome', 'Jessica vows to prove Hope''s innocence, even though it means tracking down a terrifying figure from her own past.', '/mmZXXJAEuDfid42mFotL3PGes41.jpg', '2015-11-20', 52),
  ('JJ1', 2, 'AKA It''s Called Whiskey', 'It won''t be easy to acquire or deploy, but Jessica thinks she''s found a weapon to use against Kilgrave. Luke and Jessica bond over their similarities.', '/ynaolUGV5E3Cr0zxTb4UVQGVzIq.jpg', '2015-11-20', 50),
  ('JJ1', 3, 'AKA 99 Friends', 'A new case demands attention as Jessica tries to find out who''s spying on her for Kilgrave. Trish''s radio show yields unexpected consequences.', '/8IjT1LCsvbfwTIkAtQNmlNgBenS.jpg', '2015-11-20', 52),
  ('JJ1', 4, 'AKA The Sandwich Saved Me', 'Despite Jessica''s objections, Trish''s new friend Simpson gets involved in the hunt for Kilgrave. Jessica recalls a pivotal moment in her life.', '/bMTbeKU2YypH53DSAgYlOPxpgLv.jpg', '2015-11-20', 55),
  ('JJ1', 5, 'AKA You''re a Winner!', 'Luke hires Jessica to help him find someone who may have skipped town, but she fears he''ll learn too much about her history in the process.', '/6KZu2xbcDZ6SZmhMCH64s0ZhCw4.jpg', '2015-11-20', 57),
  ('JJ1', 6, 'AKA Top Shelf Perverts', 'Malcolm, Simpson and Trish go rogue to prevent Jessica from carrying out an extreme plan to outwit Kilgrave.', '/d1Xk3ptFt8UYDBwgnqOJDyC23QV.jpg', '2015-11-20', 52),
  ('JJ1', 7, 'AKA WWJD?', 'Jessica experiences a strange homecoming courtesy of Kilgrave. Hograth''s conflict with her estranged wife reaches a tipping point.', '/oCBXVGx4r3Hzyu2zWi9j9UdvvHD.jpg', '2015-11-20', 57),
  ('JJ1', 8, 'AKA Sin Bin', 'Just when Jessica has Kilgrave right where she want''s him, Hogarth''s involvement complicates the situation. Details of Kilgrave''s past emerge.', '/rjRBAIoTWrbHbtBhBsLNtEzcz6J.jpg', '2015-11-20', 55),
  ('JJ1', 9, 'AKA 1,000 Cuts', 'A discovery has the potential to change the entire game - if Jessica can refuse Kilgrave''s offer.', '/xGb7NMYU5nAJhhbiRcZvl6qdjwJ.jpg', '2015-11-20', 52),
  ('JJ1', 10, 'AKA I''ve Got the Blues', 'Jessica searches morgues for clues. Trish goes all out to keep Simpson from getting in Jessica''s way. Malcolm has an epiphany.', '/4oeTuWu6dwHi53HHvCR6Nj0jhng.jpg', '2015-11-20', 55),
